(1789013, 244852, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely outstanding.  Nothing about this isn''t spectacular.  The velvet water is like soft cotton. The tonality and the bridge - WOW double WOW!!!</td>', 'This is absolutely outstanding.  Nothing about this isn''t spectacular.  The velvet water is like soft cotton. The tonality and the bridge - WOW double WOW!!!', '2005-10-17 01:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
