(1789017, 242691, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of downtown CHI. I think I would have liked to see more sky as the cloud cover is very interesting. Horizon seems a bit tilted to the left as well.</td>', 'Nice shot of downtown CHI. I think I would have liked to see more sky as the cloud cover is very interesting. Horizon seems a bit tilted to the left as well.', '2005-10-17 01:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
