(1789027, 245126, 45194, '<td valign="top">Great color!, Love the clouds too...doesn''t seem like you should get this much sun on the ground with that kind of cloud cover - 7</td>', 'Great color!, Love the clouds too...doesn''t seem like you should get this much sun on the ground with that kind of cloud cover - 7', '2005-10-17 01:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789028, 244352, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely and so soothing.  The hint of blue sky between the trees is a nice touch.  Great light and shadows!! I want to go there!</td>', 'Lovely and so soothing.  The hint of blue sky between the trees is a nice touch.  Great light and shadows!! I want to go there!', '2005-10-17 01:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789031, 242691, 1128, '<td valign="top">I love the little messages on the buildings.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I love the little messages on the buildings.  Nice shot!', '2005-10-17 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789032, 243045, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great depth!  8</td>', 'Great depth!  8', '2005-10-17 01:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789035, 243153, 3524, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of Mars, the Pleiades, and Hyades. Nice work capturing the sense of false dawn from the city lights to the east. Collapsing the horizon right to the bottom of the frame gives a great sense of wide-open-ness. I really like your use of the sillouetted phtographer/astronomer as a catch. Bummer that noise smoothing ended up cancelling out some of the fainter stars that were likely evident. But I know how the "too much noise" responses can be an incentive.</td>', 'Very nice capture of Mars, the Pleiades, and Hyades. Nice work capturing the sense of false dawn from the city lights to the east. Collapsing the horizon right to the bottom of the frame gives a great sense of wide-open-ness. I really like your use of the sillouetted phtographer/astronomer as a catch. Bummer that noise smoothing ended up cancelling out some of the fainter stars that were likely evident. But I know how the "too much noise" responses can be an incentive.', '2005-10-17 01:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789037, 245150, 45194, '<td valign="top">Great shot...very expansive - 7</td>', 'Great shot...very expansive - 7', '2005-10-17 01:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
