(1789104, 244824, 4967, '<td valign="top">While I might be able to see the wide angle take on this... I''m not sure it was the best subject for a wide angle challenge (that''s just my opinion) I like the natural lighting though, and the simple color scheme... for this it actually bothers me a tad that the candlestick is just BARELY off the center line...</td>', 'While I might be able to see the wide angle take on this... I''m not sure it was the best subject for a wide angle challenge (that''s just my opinion) I like the natural lighting though, and the simple color scheme... for this it actually bothers me a tad that the candlestick is just BARELY off the center line...', '2005-10-17 01:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
