(1789343, 244173, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shapes in this picture. A bit of sharpening (Unsharp Mask works best) would really bring out the detail in the trees.</td>', 'Great shapes in this picture. A bit of sharpening (Unsharp Mask works best) would really bring out the detail in the trees.', '2005-10-17 02:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
