(1789349, 243997, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice, rich duotone. Very crisp looking. Inclusion of the window is a nice touch, and balances the dark corner in the LR nicely.  I take it your intention was to illustrate how overwhelming "too much stuff" can be. Point well taken.</td>', 'Nice, rich duotone. Very crisp looking. Inclusion of the window is a nice touch, and balances the dark corner in the LR nicely.  I take it your intention was to illustrate how overwhelming "too much stuff" can be. Point well taken.', '2005-10-17 02:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789351, 243934, 17507, '<td valign="top">now that''s grand, if it''s anything... what a place. great capture.</td>', 'now that''s grand, if it''s anything... what a place. great capture.', '2005-10-17 02:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789354, 242545, 17507, '<td valign="top">There are some bright spots in this image (e.g., stripes on the house, highlights on bushes to the left, strip of grass in the foreground) that draw the eye overmuch. rein in your highlights and this would be more effective.</td>', 'There are some bright spots in this image (e.g., stripes on the house, highlights on bushes to the left, strip of grass in the foreground) that draw the eye overmuch. rein in your highlights and this would be more effective.', '2005-10-17 02:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789355, 245172, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>WOW! This is great. I love the color saturation, the composition, detail, etc. I rated it a one on the challenge criteria because it doesn''t have what I am looking for in a "wide angle" photo, but other than that personal preference, you have an awesome photo here. Nice work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 WOW! This is great. I love the color saturation, the composition, detail, etc. I rated it a one on the challenge criteria because it doesn''t have what I am looking for in a "wide angle" photo, but other than that personal preference, you have an awesome photo here. Nice work.', '2005-10-17 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789358, 244735, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. The boats in the foreground add to the sense of depth. The glow above the mountains is off-putting... I don''t know if the sky was really like that or if that''s an artifact of post-processing, but I wish it weren''t there.</td>', 'Great reflection. The boats in the foreground add to the sense of depth. The glow above the mountains is off-putting... I don''t know if the sky was really like that or if that''s an artifact of post-processing, but I wish it weren''t there.', '2005-10-17 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789359, 245168, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-10-17 02:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789362, 244731, 17507, '<td valign="top">good old 18mm...<br/>for all-purpose control of bright skies, try duplicating the sky (select it and copy it to another layer) and set the layer''s blending mode to "multiply." that often helps a lot.</td>', 'good old 18mm...for all-purpose control of bright skies, try duplicating the sky (select it and copy it to another layer) and set the layer''s blending mode to "multiply." that often helps a lot.', '2005-10-17 02:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789364, 244916, 17507, '<td valign="top">great lines in this picture. I''m sure a lot of people are going to tell you that. they''re right. the people add a lot to this picture as well. while this picture has a lot of merit, I feel like it''s lacking a strong focal point. My eye is sort of drawn to the bridge tower, and sort of drawn to the people below it, but neither really grabs me. a version of this with a bit more contrast between the tower and the sky (darker tower, maybe) might be worth seeing.</td>', 'great lines in this picture. I''m sure a lot of people are going to tell you that. they''re right. the people add a lot to this picture as well. while this picture has a lot of merit, I feel like it''s lacking a strong focal point. My eye is sort of drawn to the bridge tower, and sort of drawn to the people below it, but neither really grabs me. a version of this with a bit more contrast between the tower and the sky (darker tower, maybe) might be worth seeing.', '2005-10-17 02:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789365, 244838, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like a beautiful place. I wish the sun weren''t glaring so...glaringly!</td>', 'looks like a beautiful place. I wish the sun weren''t glaring so...glaringly!', '2005-10-17 02:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789369, 245050, 17507, '<td valign="top">hmm<br/>I think you''re the only person on DPC who uses a dash in the title so consistently.</td>', 'hmmI think you''re the only person on DPC who uses a dash in the title so consistently.', '2005-10-17 02:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789372, 242598, 42310, '<td valign="top">Hervey Bay, great place to live. nice pic, a little dark. 6</td>', 'Hervey Bay, great place to live. nice pic, a little dark. 6', '2005-10-17 02:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789393, 244822, 39007, '<td valign="top">I like the driver and his cap, gives the image some interest. Pity you didn''t ask him to move his car so his was the only vehicle in the image, would have been even stronger then. 8</td>', 'I like the driver and his cap, gives the image some interest. Pity you didn''t ask him to move his car so his was the only vehicle in the image, would have been even stronger then. 8', '2005-10-17 03:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789398, 243799, 39007, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful colors, 10</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful colors, 10', '2005-10-17 03:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789400, 244981, 39007, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the b&amp;w, would be interested to see the colour version. Perhaps a lower camera angle or different crop would have remove the distracting bridge in the background. 7</td>', 'Not sure about the b&w, would be interested to see the colour version. Perhaps a lower camera angle or different crop would have remove the distracting bridge in the background. 7', '2005-10-17 03:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789412, 244953, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of boils for anyone to have. ;-)<br/> <br/>The black and white works well here.</td>', 'That''s a lot of boils for anyone to have. ;-) The black and white works well here.', '2005-10-17 03:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789413, 245021, 7690, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. Really follows the Rule of Thirds. Love that sky and the shadows. Has to be a winner.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. Really follows the Rule of Thirds. Love that sky and the shadows. Has to be a winner.', '2005-10-17 03:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789415, 243153, 30392, '<td valign="top">Excellent, very good editing, no noise I can see! I love the composition with the foreground and the small  silouhette</td>', 'Excellent, very good editing, no noise I can see! I love the composition with the foreground and the small  silouhette', '2005-10-17 04:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789417, 244426, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a fun, dynamic photo... good job with dof so you can clearly see both kids... I just wish that you had a better background... also I kind of wish the kids looked like they were having more fun... just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a fun, dynamic photo... good job with dof so you can clearly see both kids... I just wish that you had a better background... also I kind of wish the kids looked like they were having more fun... just my opinion.', '2005-10-17 04:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789418, 242545, 4967, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look real to me... like perhaps you applied a bit too much of a blurring filter to everything around the cabin?  maybe I''m wrong though... I I kind of wish the cabin followed the rule of thirds... also I might have suggested perhaps trying for a slightly different angle?  Pretty though.</td>', 'This doesn''t look real to me... like perhaps you applied a bit too much of a blurring filter to everything around the cabin?  maybe I''m wrong though... I I kind of wish the cabin followed the rule of thirds... also I might have suggested perhaps trying for a slightly different angle?  Pretty though.', '2005-10-17 04:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789419, 245139, 23891, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does the sky seem unnaturally dark? It''s almost as if the sky is underexposed and the sand is overexposed.</td>', 'Is it just me or does the sky seem unnaturally dark? It''s almost as if the sky is underexposed and the sand is overexposed.', '2005-10-17 04:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789420, 244193, 4967, '<td valign="top">Fun and different photo... very artsy.. and I kind of like the fact that the sky is blown out... this almost looks like another world... it lends itself well to the "wide angle" look.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fun and different photo... very artsy.. and I kind of like the fact that the sky is blown out... this almost looks like another world... it lends itself well to the "wide angle" look.  Good luck.', '2005-10-17 04:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789423, 244551, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.. I kind of wish you had stepped back and maybe to the left just a tad to get the viewers'' feet in the image and perhaps fill the space with just a tad more of the observatory... but that''s not too big of a deal.  Really great job with exposure and difficult lighting.  Very nice. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.. I kind of wish you had stepped back and maybe to the left just a tad to get the viewers'' feet in the image and perhaps fill the space with just a tad more of the observatory... but that''s not too big of a deal.  Really great job with exposure and difficult lighting.  Very nice. Good luck.', '2005-10-17 04:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789424, 244083, 23891, '<td valign="top">This looks way oversharpened to me. Or maybe the contrast was pushed too far?</td>', 'This looks way oversharpened to me. Or maybe the contrast was pushed too far?', '2005-10-17 04:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789425, 242887, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting... and I think it lends itslef well to the wide angle idea... nice perspective getting right below it and looking up. good luck.</td>', 'This is really interesting... and I think it lends itslef well to the wide angle idea... nice perspective getting right below it and looking up. good luck.', '2005-10-17 04:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789427, 244047, 25355, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon of this photo is, to put it bluntly, a failure.</td>', 'The crooked horizon of this photo is, to put it bluntly, a failure.', '2005-10-17 04:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789431, 244541, 23891, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this picture, but I suggest losing the cheesy frame and using something more conventional for web presentation.</td>', 'I REALLY like this picture, but I suggest losing the cheesy frame and using something more conventional for web presentation.', '2005-10-17 04:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789433, 245134, 4967, '<td valign="top">It''ll be interesting to see how you did this, and just how much photoshop went into this.  This is REALLY cool as a piece of art/computer graphic, but to me, it just doesn''t look all that much like a photograph... Would definitely make for a cool background though, and the car is a great dream :-D</td>', 'It''ll be interesting to see how you did this, and just how much photoshop went into this.  This is REALLY cool as a piece of art/computer graphic, but to me, it just doesn''t look all that much like a photograph... Would definitely make for a cool background though, and the car is a great dream :-D', '2005-10-17 04:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789435, 242588, 25355, '<td valign="top">This looks like a colour photo from a pinhole camera. I''m sure you will get pilloried for the soft focus.</td>', 'This looks like a colour photo from a pinhole camera. I''m sure you will get pilloried for the soft focus.', '2005-10-17 04:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789437, 243805, 23891, '<td valign="top">This is wide angle?</td>', 'This is wide angle?', '2005-10-17 04:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789438, 244853, 25355, '<td valign="top">The tree in the foreground is too central.</td>', 'The tree in the foreground is too central.', '2005-10-17 04:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789444, 245092, 21816, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame about the big blown out entrance to the car park there! In a way it adds to it but in a way it doesn''t for me.</td>', 'It''s a shame about the big blown out entrance to the car park there! In a way it adds to it but in a way it doesn''t for me.', '2005-10-17 04:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789446, 244556, 36692, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2005-10-17 04:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789447, 245015, 39880, '<td valign="top">My top pick of the challenge.  All I can say is nicely done.</td>', 'My top pick of the challenge.  All I can say is nicely done.', '2005-10-17 04:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789448, 243808, 21816, '<td valign="top">That border is very distracting for me.....maybe if it wasn''t quite as thick??</td>', 'That border is very distracting for me.....maybe if it wasn''t quite as thick??', '2005-10-17 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789449, 245015, 42392, '<td valign="top">great shot. i love the angle and the colors=10</td>', 'great shot. i love the angle and the colors=10', '2005-10-17 05:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789460, 244866, 21604, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but I really would prefer it all in color.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but I really would prefer it all in color.', '2005-10-17 05:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789462, 244220, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. Nice hook grip. Weight may be a little too much on left side, ball a bit far back in stance, but hard to read the angle. Nice shot, thouhg. (grin)</td>', 'Hmmm.. Nice hook grip. Weight may be a little too much on left side, ball a bit far back in stance, but hard to read the angle. Nice shot, thouhg. (grin)', '2005-10-17 05:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789472, 244970, 45965, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked it more if I  could see the face of the person on the ground, preferrably with a fun facial expression.</td>', 'I''d have liked it more if I  could see the face of the person on the ground, preferrably with a fun facial expression.', '2005-10-17 05:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789474, 244338, 45965, '<td valign="top">Lovely symmetry, and the overblown bits adds mood to the picture. The big white windows distract the eye from the person though, maybe it had been more powerful if the doorway was the brightest part of the picture?</td>', 'Lovely symmetry, and the overblown bits adds mood to the picture. The big white windows distract the eye from the person though, maybe it had been more powerful if the doorway was the brightest part of the picture?', '2005-10-17 05:57:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1789480, 245165, 45965, '<td valign="top">Fun. Won''t as fun tomorrow though. :)</td>', 'Fun. Won''t as fun tomorrow though. :)', '2005-10-17 06:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789482, 244537, 45965, '<td valign="top">Pity the nose is obscured, otherwise a nice picture and good use of b/w.<br/>Feels like it''s possibly leaning a bit to the left (?)</td>', 'Pity the nose is obscured, otherwise a nice picture and good use of b/w.Feels like it''s possibly leaning a bit to the left (?)', '2005-10-17 06:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789483, 244452, 45965, '<td valign="top">Cool, I love these geometric abstracts.</td>', 'Cool, I love these geometric abstracts.', '2005-10-17 06:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789485, 244150, 45965, '<td valign="top">Feels like maybe too little interest in the foreground. Nice sky and mountain though.</td>', 'Feels like maybe too little interest in the foreground. Nice sky and mountain though.', '2005-10-17 06:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789486, 244941, 45965, '<td valign="top">NIcely done long exposure. Is the picture leaning to the left?</td>', 'NIcely done long exposure. Is the picture leaning to the left?', '2005-10-17 06:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789487, 243473, 23394, '<td valign="top">fave by me.  good luck!</td>', 'fave by me.  good luck!', '2005-10-17 06:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789489, 244425, 45965, '<td valign="top">I like this, good use of wide angle to get both foreground, medium distance and background interest. Good motion in the runner.</td>', 'I like this, good use of wide angle to get both foreground, medium distance and background interest. Good motion in the runner.', '2005-10-17 06:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789492, 245015, 45965, '<td valign="top">Bladerunner feeling... nice</td>', 'Bladerunner feeling... nice', '2005-10-17 06:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789494, 244561, 45965, '<td valign="top">A nice view and cool reflections but I miss some kind of foreground interest, the birds are too small and far away to really work as the main subject</td>', 'A nice view and cool reflections but I miss some kind of foreground interest, the birds are too small and far away to really work as the main subject', '2005-10-17 06:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789495, 244650, 30861, '<td valign="top">I just love this one, it''s palpably exhilirating. I''m assuming you were sitting in a kayak on top of a car? Or the camera was mounted there anyway... The pure symmetry of the tiedowns is a grace note that strikes me. And of course the image is TOTALLY centered, symmetrical, which is a no-no in DPC terms so yoi get poitns for me just ''cuz you made it work.</td>', 'I just love this one, it''s palpably exhilirating. I''m assuming you were sitting in a kayak on top of a car? Or the camera was mounted there anyway... The pure symmetry of the tiedowns is a grace note that strikes me. And of course the image is TOTALLY centered, symmetrical, which is a no-no in DPC terms so yoi get poitns for me just ''cuz you made it work.', '2005-10-17 06:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789497, 244916, 45965, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I would have been tempted to clone out one of the couples and the left-most bench too make it even cleaner</td>', 'Very nice... I would have been tempted to clone out one of the couples and the left-most bench too make it even cleaner', '2005-10-17 06:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789498, 244015, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully controlled, almost perfectly framed. Nice job!</td>', 'Beautifully controlled, almost perfectly framed. Nice job!', '2005-10-17 06:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789499, 244978, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I might like it more if the blue coat were desatted a bit more, but all in all it''s an intrigiuning image that keeps me looking. I liek that no faces are visible.</td>', 'I like this very much. I might like it more if the blue coat were desatted a bit more, but all in all it''s an intrigiuning image that keeps me looking. I liek that no faces are visible.', '2005-10-17 06:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789501, 245091, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lot of joie de vivre in this :-) I like it!</td>', 'Lot of joie de vivre in this :-) I like it!', '2005-10-17 06:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789503, 243465, 45965, '<td valign="top">Good idea, however maybe it would have been better to take the picture from the other side to make the open mailbox stand out more. You have to look for it now.</td>', 'Good idea, however maybe it would have been better to take the picture from the other side to make the open mailbox stand out more. You have to look for it now.', '2005-10-17 06:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789504, 242864, 30861, '<td valign="top">For my taste, the best of the fisheyes. Really nicely framed, wonderful distribution of negative and positive spaces, nearly a centered composition but out of kiler a little bit in everyw ay. Good work!</td>', 'For my taste, the best of the fisheyes. Really nicely framed, wonderful distribution of negative and positive spaces, nearly a centered composition but out of kiler a little bit in everyw ay. Good work!', '2005-10-17 06:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789505, 243153, 30861, '<td valign="top">I suspect this has to be a winner. It''s very beguiling.</td>', 'I suspect this has to be a winner. It''s very beguiling.', '2005-10-17 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789506, 243473, 45965, '<td valign="top">A classic - seen before but still good. The wires on the left is a candidate for cloning out, I feel they are slightly distracting.</td>', 'A classic - seen before but still good. The wires on the left is a candidate for cloning out, I feel they are slightly distracting.', '2005-10-17 06:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789507, 244729, 45965, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a nice view but to me there''s a lack of interest in the foreground, a main subject if you will.</td>', 'Great colors and a nice view but to me there''s a lack of interest in the foreground, a main subject if you will.', '2005-10-17 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789510, 243991, 45965, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and b/w toning</td>', 'Nice perspective and b/w toning', '2005-10-17 06:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789512, 245179, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great showing off of the DOF here</td>', 'Great showing off of the DOF here', '2005-10-17 06:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789514, 244677, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is an "almost" in my book. It''s very nice, but compositionally it''s a little off for me. Horizon too close to centered, lighthouse too close to centered, wave line too close to centered... Everything except the surfer is forcing us to that wave/lighthouse interface. The sky seems an afterthought, sort of... The little curl of light on a wavelet behind the surfboard (or is that driftwood?) is quite distracting too. Try cloning out that "driftwood" and cropping out half the sky, and watch how it changes the dynamics of the composition dramatically. Still, a strong entry, lovely light. Well seen!</td>', 'This is an "almost" in my book. It''s very nice, but compositionally it''s a little off for me. Horizon too close to centered, lighthouse too close to centered, wave line too close to centered... Everything except the surfer is forcing us to that wave/lighthouse interface. The sky seems an afterthought, sort of... The little curl of light on a wavelet behind the surfboard (or is that driftwood?) is quite distracting too. Try cloning out that "driftwood" and cropping out half the sky, and watch how it changes the dynamics of the composition dramatically. Still, a strong entry, lovely light. Well seen!', '2005-10-17 06:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789517, 244562, 45965, '<td valign="top">The strongest element here in my opinion, the misty mouintain line, is  overpowered bny the white clouds that are not that interesting. A quite low and wide panoramic crop would be more powerful I think. Try maybe including only as much cloud on the left side as you have blue sky at the edge.</td>', 'The strongest element here in my opinion, the misty mouintain line, is  overpowered bny the white clouds that are not that interesting. A quite low and wide panoramic crop would be more powerful I think. Try maybe including only as much cloud on the left side as you have blue sky at the edge.', '2005-10-17 06:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789519, 244729, 16053, '<td valign="top">I''m not shure if thid revel a wide angle. But nice color photo.</td>', 'I''m not shure if thid revel a wide angle. But nice color photo.', '2005-10-17 06:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789522, 244543, 45965, '<td valign="top">Fun but busy, busy :)</td>', 'Fun but busy, busy :)', '2005-10-17 06:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789523, 244279, 16053, '<td valign="top">A good example of wide angle, at least im my opinion. Good chice of b&amp;w.</td>', 'A good example of wide angle, at least im my opinion. Good chice of b&w.', '2005-10-17 06:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789524, 245107, 45965, '<td valign="top">Fun and very graphic, I ike it</td>', 'Fun and very graphic, I ike it', '2005-10-17 06:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789526, 243560, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good technique and wide angle. I think people is forgetting what perspective add to the wideness of th angle.</td>', 'Good technique and wide angle. I think people is forgetting what perspective add to the wideness of th angle.', '2005-10-17 06:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789527, 244778, 45965, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped off the buildings on the left to make a cleaner composition. NIce colors.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped off the buildings on the left to make a cleaner composition. NIce colors.', '2005-10-17 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789529, 243523, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good wide angle. I love the rusty look i the ceilling.</td>', 'Good wide angle. I love the rusty look i the ceilling.', '2005-10-17 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789534, 244541, 45965, '<td valign="top">Pity there is a tree on the left bank, would have been cleaner witout it but nothing much you can do. Great colors and I like the composition. Maybe the white (city?) lights at the lwer edge could be toned down a bit to not draw attention from the bridge.</td>', 'Pity there is a tree on the left bank, would have been cleaner witout it but nothing much you can do. Great colors and I like the composition. Maybe the white (city?) lights at the lwer edge could be toned down a bit to not draw attention from the bridge.', '2005-10-17 06:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789537, 244978, 45965, '<td valign="top">Very good, was about to say "too centered" but I think it works. A bit ambivalent on the selective coloring, maybe all b/w would work well too. NIce picture!</td>', 'Very good, was about to say "too centered" but I think it works. A bit ambivalent on the selective coloring, maybe all b/w would work well too. NIce picture!', '2005-10-17 06:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789539, 245146, 45965, '<td valign="top">Frankly not very interesting. Sorry. :-)</td>', 'Frankly not very interesting. Sorry. :-)', '2005-10-17 06:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789541, 244174, 45965, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good composition. Feel a bit unsharp overall though.<br/>EDIT: I''d like to revise that, I confused softness with the effect you get around backlit objects. Nice work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-25 18:12:07.</i></td>', 'Great idea and good composition. Feel a bit unsharp overall though.EDIT: I''d like to revise that, I confused softness with the effect you get around backlit objects. Nice work!', '2005-10-17 06:45:09.000000', '2005-10-25 19:12:07.000000', 1),
(1789542, 245039, 45965, '<td valign="top">Cool, How close were you? :-)</td>', 'Cool, How close were you? :-)', '2005-10-17 06:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789544, 245171, 45965, '<td valign="top">The lean to the right is distracting, otherwise a very nice graphic landscape. I''d have wanted to see more of the road and telephone poles for a slightly different composition.</td>', 'The lean to the right is distracting, otherwise a very nice graphic landscape. I''d have wanted to see more of the road and telephone poles for a slightly different composition.', '2005-10-17 06:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789545, 244542, 45965, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition. I wonder if it isn''t leaning slightly to the right though (crooked horizons is a pet peieve of mine...)</td>', 'Great colors and composition. I wonder if it isn''t leaning slightly to the right though (crooked horizons is a pet peieve of mine...)', '2005-10-17 06:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789548, 244721, 45965, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with clear water, and I think maybe the grass in the foreground could be cropped off. NIce place and nice colors.</td>', 'Would have been better with clear water, and I think maybe the grass in the foreground could be cropped off. NIce place and nice colors.', '2005-10-17 06:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789549, 245105, 45965, '<td valign="top">Very interesting skies with the layers of clouds. A pity the birds aren''t more visible, would have added to the interest, still very nice picture.</td>', 'Very interesting skies with the layers of clouds. A pity the birds aren''t more visible, would have added to the interest, still very nice picture.', '2005-10-17 06:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789550, 244998, 45965, '<td valign="top">HAd been more interesting with a speaker and an audience I think</td>', 'HAd been more interesting with a speaker and an audience I think', '2005-10-17 06:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789554, 244542, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great. 8</td>', 'Great. 8', '2005-10-17 07:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789559, 244991, 10261, '<td valign="top">Wide angle lenses generally aren''t very flattering for portraiture, and I''m afraid that this isn''t an exception. I like the warm light, the pose and the DoF, but the wide angle distortion makes her head look oversized. Perhaps if you had shot this from near her feet to create that ''legs that go on for miles'' look that high heels are designed to emphasize, the distortion could have worked in your favor.<br/> <br/>Is she wrapped in cellophane?</td>', 'Wide angle lenses generally aren''t very flattering for portraiture, and I''m afraid that this isn''t an exception. I like the warm light, the pose and the DoF, but the wide angle distortion makes her head look oversized. Perhaps if you had shot this from near her feet to create that ''legs that go on for miles'' look that high heels are designed to emphasize, the distortion could have worked in your favor. Is she wrapped in cellophane?', '2005-10-17 07:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789562, 244532, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but you held the shutter open for too long, and the scene looks overexposed in places. The thing that makes it look odd is the bright sky over the city lights. If you had added a burn layer or two to hold back the sky it would probably look alright. There also seems to be some distortion in the fine details (perhaps you moved the camera a little while the shutter was open). A good solid tripod is non-optional equipment for shots like this.</td>', 'I like the idea, but you held the shutter open for too long, and the scene looks overexposed in places. The thing that makes it look odd is the bright sky over the city lights. If you had added a burn layer or two to hold back the sky it would probably look alright. There also seems to be some distortion in the fine details (perhaps you moved the camera a little while the shutter was open). A good solid tripod is non-optional equipment for shots like this.', '2005-10-17 07:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789563, 244822, 45965, '<td valign="top">I think the treeline competes a bit with the outline of the car and driver, maybe try a slightly different angle? B/W fits the period, the white car on the left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think the treeline competes a bit with the outline of the car and driver, maybe try a slightly different angle? B/W fits the period, the white car on the left is a bit distracting.', '2005-10-17 07:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789565, 243933, 45965, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit busy and the rider could have been slightly sharper. Good attempt at panning though, something I''m really bad at. A little more room over the head and less under the bike would perhaps make it a better composition. Nice sense of motion.</td>', 'The background is a bit busy and the rider could have been slightly sharper. Good attempt at panning though, something I''m really bad at. A little more room over the head and less under the bike would perhaps make it a better composition. Nice sense of motion.', '2005-10-17 07:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789566, 244453, 45965, '<td valign="top">Gruesome... :-)</td>', 'Gruesome... :-)', '2005-10-17 07:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789567, 244170, 10261, '<td valign="top">I find the full side of the building rather uninteresting. Perhaps if you''d moved in on some specific feature, such as the seam between the block of windows and the rest of the wall, it''d be a bit more interesting. As far as relevance to the topic: although this was probably taken at a wide angle, the perspective shift that causes the top of the building to look narrower than the bottom is the only real indication of this, and that''s typically viewed as a flaw in architectural photography.<br/></td>', 'I find the full side of the building rather uninteresting. Perhaps if you''d moved in on some specific feature, such as the seam between the block of windows and the rest of the wall, it''d be a bit more interesting. As far as relevance to the topic: although this was probably taken at a wide angle, the perspective shift that causes the top of the building to look narrower than the bottom is the only real indication of this, and that''s typically viewed as a flaw in architectural photography.', '2005-10-17 07:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789568, 243795, 15497, '<td valign="top">Great Idea! Really like this<br/>10</td>', 'Great Idea! Really like this10', '2005-10-17 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789569, 245021, 45965, '<td valign="top">NIce desolate feeling and great colors. I would like to see a version of this picture in a toned b/w as well.</td>', 'NIce desolate feeling and great colors. I would like to see a version of this picture in a toned b/w as well.', '2005-10-17 07:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
