(1789572, 244283, 45965, '<td valign="top">The lean to the left (check that the reflections line up under the tower) takes away from this in my opinion. The tower and its reflection is nicely framed by the branch.</td>', 'The lean to the left (check that the reflections line up under the tower) takes away from this in my opinion. The tower and its reflection is nicely framed by the branch.', '2005-10-17 07:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
