(1789713, 245014, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different take on the challenge.  Wonderful detail in the guy''s face and hand.  The sparkle in the eye is great.  Good perspective.  I like this - one of my favs.  As beautiful as all of the landscapes are, I like this because of the originality. 9</td>', 'Interesting and different take on the challenge.  Wonderful detail in the guy''s face and hand.  The sparkle in the eye is great.  Good perspective.  I like this - one of my favs.  As beautiful as all of the landscapes are, I like this because of the originality. 9', '2005-10-17 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789714, 245170, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of the wide open spaces. The leaning fence post helps ground the shot.  The use of light and shadow is nicely achieved.  The barn in the background gives your eye a 2nd place to rest.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'I like the sense of the wide open spaces. The leaning fence post helps ground the shot.  The use of light and shadow is nicely achieved.  The barn in the background gives your eye a 2nd place to rest.  Nicely done. 8', '2005-10-17 09:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
