(1789717, 245095, 15711, '<td valign="top">Normally, I don''t like the subject to be dead center, but this certainly works.  Great use of filter too. The house over to the right is a nice added touch. Wonderful subject and title.  The sky surrounds him like a beautiful blanket!  Bravo 9</td>', 'Normally, I don''t like the subject to be dead center, but this certainly works.  Great use of filter too. The house over to the right is a nice added touch. Wonderful subject and title.  The sky surrounds him like a beautiful blanket!  Bravo 9', '2005-10-17 09:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789720, 244995, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!  With all of the greens and blues of so many shots, this is definitely one of my favorites.  I don''t know how you achieved it.  Just stunning. The swirl of the water with the swirling sky - MAN!  I want this hanging on my wall. The clarity of the reflection is stellar. Great composition - that little "island" really helps break it up.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Oh my!!  With all of the greens and blues of so many shots, this is definitely one of my favorites.  I don''t know how you achieved it.  Just stunning. The swirl of the water with the swirling sky - MAN!  I want this hanging on my wall. The clarity of the reflection is stellar. Great composition - that little "island" really helps break it up.  Beautiful.', '2005-10-17 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1789721, 245039, 16493, '<td valign="top">I would prefere not to take wide angle shots of a horses ass!<br/>I suggest next time to try to get to the hores side or front.</td>', 'I would prefere not to take wide angle shots of a horses ass!I suggest next time to try to get to the hores side or front.', '2005-10-17 09:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
