(1789790, 244970, 15711, '<td valign="top">If this weren''t so tack sharp, I''d almost say it had too much of a snapshot sense.  But it''s fun and well executed.  I love the perspective. Now tell that girl to go wash off her feet. LOL<br/> <br/>Thanks for the smile. 7</td>', 'If this weren''t so tack sharp, I''d almost say it had too much of a snapshot sense.  But it''s fun and well executed.  I love the perspective. Now tell that girl to go wash off her feet. LOL Thanks for the smile. 7', '2005-10-17 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
