(1789792, 243523, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I love the softness of it. The old rusty red roof amidst the green and blue is stunning. The natural frame of the trees is spot on. I like the long shadows on the grass too. Perfect sky color.  Those clouds couldn''t be any better if you hand drew them yourself!  Great job.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I love the softness of it. The old rusty red roof amidst the green and blue is stunning. The natural frame of the trees is spot on. I like the long shadows on the grass too. Perfect sky color.  Those clouds couldn''t be any better if you hand drew them yourself!  Great job.', '2005-10-17 10:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
