(1790630, 244998, 26236, '<td valign="top">This challenge is full of great pictures, but I think this is my favorite. Too bad I can''t vote!</td>', 'This challenge is full of great pictures, but I think this is my favorite. Too bad I can''t vote!', '2005-10-17 18:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
