(1790645, 244539, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this shot with the two spectators in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the framing of this shot with the two spectators in the foreground.', '2005-10-17 18:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790650, 245090, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections.  I think this image is lacking a strong subject, however.  The church on the left would seem to be it, but it is way off to the side of the image pulling your eye and attention out of the picture.</td>', 'Nice reflections.  I think this image is lacking a strong subject, however.  The church on the left would seem to be it, but it is way off to the side of the image pulling your eye and attention out of the picture.', '2005-10-17 18:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790652, 245015, 18374, '<td valign="top">That''s wild!  I like it...</td>', 'That''s wild!  I like it...', '2005-10-17 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790655, 243807, 23891, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but doesn''t look particularly "wide".</td>', 'Very pretty, but doesn''t look particularly "wide".', '2005-10-17 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790659, 243933, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  Good job with the pan.</td>', 'Nice effect.  Good job with the pan.', '2005-10-17 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790668, 244124, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  My one complaint is totally related to the challenge topic- There is nothing in the frame to give any indication that this is a wide angle shot.  It needs something to give the viewer perspective.</td>', 'Very nice!  My one complaint is totally related to the challenge topic- There is nothing in the frame to give any indication that this is a wide angle shot.  It needs something to give the viewer perspective.', '2005-10-17 19:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790688, 243153, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-10-17 19:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790707, 245015, 39675, '<td valign="top">I think this is a perfect fit to this challenge.  Good use of your lense.  Great capture.</td>', 'I think this is a perfect fit to this challenge.  Good use of your lense.  Great capture.', '2005-10-17 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790711, 244714, 39675, '<td valign="top">Very good effect created by your lense.  Love the mirrored effect.</td>', 'Very good effect created by your lense.  Love the mirrored effect.', '2005-10-17 19:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790733, 244824, 42005, '<td valign="top">Thiis is one of the most delightful photographs I have viewed in a very long time.  The<br/>crispness is wonderful, but the stories (told in the photograph and yet to be unveiled when<br/>one''s imagination attends the dinner or conjures the makeup of invitees, or the menu) totally <br/>capture and captivate my imagination. Wonderful on all levels. Thank you for sharing such a <br/>delightful and different scene. 10<br/></td>', 'Thiis is one of the most delightful photographs I have viewed in a very long time.  Thecrispness is wonderful, but the stories (told in the photograph and yet to be unveiled whenone''s imagination attends the dinner or conjures the makeup of invitees, or the menu) totally capture and captivate my imagination. Wonderful on all levels. Thank you for sharing such a delightful and different scene. 10', '2005-10-17 19:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790757, 244352, 27514, '<td valign="top">lacks crispness in a bad way. I do like the use of color and the very faint person on pathway though</td>', 'lacks crispness in a bad way. I do like the use of color and the very faint person on pathway though', '2005-10-17 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790758, 244853, 27514, '<td valign="top">white balance is off and looks a stop over exposed</td>', 'white balance is off and looks a stop over exposed', '2005-10-17 19:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790759, 245157, 18374, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I like having the river flow "into" the image.</td>', 'Great colors!  I like having the river flow "into" the image.', '2005-10-17 19:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790761, 245016, 27514, '<td valign="top">nice capture of movement and good use of black an white. the models hands seem a little confusing, but you can''t always control that on candids</td>', 'nice capture of movement and good use of black an white. the models hands seem a little confusing, but you can''t always control that on candids', '2005-10-17 19:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790762, 245179, 27514, '<td valign="top">wow great texture. lacks in crispness though and seems mabey a tad bit overesposed</td>', 'wow great texture. lacks in crispness though and seems mabey a tad bit overesposed', '2005-10-17 19:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790764, 244824, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Nice job with the lighting.  The view looks pretty good too!</td>', 'I like this.  Nice job with the lighting.  The view looks pretty good too!', '2005-10-17 19:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790768, 244563, 27514, '<td valign="top">nice use of triangular composition though the overall blue tones make it kind of a boring shot. I do like where you where going but mabey you should have included more of the green island on the left of the frame</td>', 'nice use of triangular composition though the overall blue tones make it kind of a boring shot. I do like where you where going but mabey you should have included more of the green island on the left of the frame', '2005-10-17 19:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790770, 242588, 27514, '<td valign="top">I like the use of soft focus here but it fades to far to black in the corners for it to be a succesful shot</td>', 'I like the use of soft focus here but it fades to far to black in the corners for it to be a succesful shot', '2005-10-17 19:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790771, 244095, 27514, '<td valign="top">highlight are very blown out and there is a lot to distract from your main subject matter</td>', 'highlight are very blown out and there is a lot to distract from your main subject matter', '2005-10-17 19:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790772, 243477, 27514, '<td valign="top">niced use of color contrast and leading lines. the sky is a little blown out on the left and the leaves are a little out of focus.try shooting at a bigger number aperture.</td>', 'niced use of color contrast and leading lines. the sky is a little blown out on the left and the leaves are a little out of focus.try shooting at a bigger number aperture.', '2005-10-17 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790773, 244721, 27514, '<td valign="top">nice use of color contrasts and very nice balance betwen forground and background. great shot, just lacks subject matter that "pops". I enjoy this shot though</td>', 'nice use of color contrasts and very nice balance betwen forground and background. great shot, just lacks subject matter that "pops". I enjoy this shot though', '2005-10-17 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790776, 244723, 35218, '<td valign="top">I''m interested in why you didnlt take ths photo from the front.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I''m interested in why you didnlt take ths photo from the front.  Nice capture.', '2005-10-17 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790784, 243869, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour.  The tree works very well.  A bot more foreground interest would have made this shot.</td>', 'Very nice colour.  The tree works very well.  A bot more foreground interest would have made this shot.', '2005-10-17 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790787, 243304, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and nice colouring in the early morning.  On my monitor it looks a bit too dark in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice composition and nice colouring in the early morning.  On my monitor it looks a bit too dark in the foreground.', '2005-10-17 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790814, 245039, 6388, '<td valign="top">that''s a hot ass.</td>', 'that''s a hot ass.', '2005-10-17 20:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790828, 245134, 39675, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice.  The lighting on the car is nice.  The focus could have been sharpened using USM.  The editing along the bottom and sides of the car to create a black background is poor.  It creates the appearance of a copied and pasted car on the background.</td>', 'The sky is nice.  The lighting on the car is nice.  The focus could have been sharpened using USM.  The editing along the bottom and sides of the car to create a black background is poor.  It creates the appearance of a copied and pasted car on the background.', '2005-10-17 20:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790894, 244862, 42005, '<td valign="top">I always get vertigo when looking up in GC.  I did again here,  Great photo. <br/></td>', 'I always get vertigo when looking up in GC.  I did again here,  Great photo. ', '2005-10-17 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790896, 244978, 18374, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is very nice and really fits the challenge.  It is one of my top picks.</td>', 'Wow!  This is very nice and really fits the challenge.  It is one of my top picks.', '2005-10-17 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790915, 243304, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the color in this, but it makes for very little contrast with the boat, water and sand in the foreground.  It looks a bit  unnatural to me.  Still, very nice.</td>', 'I like the color in this, but it makes for very little contrast with the boat, water and sand in the foreground.  It looks a bit  unnatural to me.  Still, very nice.', '2005-10-17 20:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790919, 244714, 18374, '<td valign="top">Great use of a fisheye!</td>', 'Great use of a fisheye!', '2005-10-17 20:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790923, 245101, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  It feels nicely balanced and is pleasing to look at.  I think B+W worked well here.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  It feels nicely balanced and is pleasing to look at.  I think B+W worked well here.', '2005-10-17 20:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790928, 244907, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  This is an interesting shot.  I might have preferred a more square crop or horizontal orientation to better simulate an eye''s perspective.  Bonus points for creativity!</td>', 'Very clever.  This is an interesting shot.  I might have preferred a more square crop or horizontal orientation to better simulate an eye''s perspective.  Bonus points for creativity!', '2005-10-17 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790957, 243795, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is a real cool shot.</td>', 'this is a real cool shot.', '2005-10-17 21:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790960, 245147, 41047, '<td valign="top">i liked the buildings leaning onto the park, watching over it.</td>', 'i liked the buildings leaning onto the park, watching over it.', '2005-10-17 21:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790964, 245015, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is a crazy shot, looks kind of futuristic. i liked it a lot.</td>', 'this is a crazy shot, looks kind of futuristic. i liked it a lot.', '2005-10-17 21:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790967, 245061, 43020, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the ''wide'' - the structure draws my eyes up and to the corner where it seems to drag the edge of the image out, it really feels like a wide angle.  Nice job!</td>', 'Nice use of the ''wide'' - the structure draws my eyes up and to the corner where it seems to drag the edge of the image out, it really feels like a wide angle.  Nice job!', '2005-10-17 21:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790970, 245008, 43020, '<td valign="top">Nice shot though doesn''t feel overly ''wide'' - the third horse also distracts me a little as it is captured on the horizon between the field and the trees.  Nice image though!</td>', 'Nice shot though doesn''t feel overly ''wide'' - the third horse also distracts me a little as it is captured on the horizon between the field and the trees.  Nice image though!', '2005-10-17 21:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790987, 245020, 44275, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. The best thing about it is that it''s somewhat difficult to tell if you''re inside or outside, when you really look at it...</td>', 'Awesome photo. The best thing about it is that it''s somewhat difficult to tell if you''re inside or outside, when you really look at it...', '2005-10-17 21:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790997, 243979, 36808, '<td valign="top">Really love the elegance of this photo.  Good job!</td>', 'Really love the elegance of this photo.  Good job!', '2005-10-17 21:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791010, 244532, 43300, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, unfortunately the sky line was blown out by all of the lights, but theres really nothing that you could do about that.</td>', 'I really like this picture, unfortunately the sky line was blown out by all of the lights, but theres really nothing that you could do about that.', '2005-10-17 21:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791018, 244976, 43300, '<td valign="top">I personally think this particular shot would be a bit nicer looking had you caugt more of the buildings above too.</td>', 'I personally think this particular shot would be a bit nicer looking had you caugt more of the buildings above too.', '2005-10-17 21:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
