(1791115, 244919, 40819, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough to know exactly what is wrong with this picture. I took someimages towards sunset of a waterfall and the same thing happened to mine, blown out sky and too dark in the forground. Maybe we can get some pointers by the time this challenge is over. Oh and I never used my waterfall images.</td>', 'I don''t know enough to know exactly what is wrong with this picture. I took someimages towards sunset of a waterfall and the same thing happened to mine, blown out sky and too dark in the forground. Maybe we can get some pointers by the time this challenge is over. Oh and I never used my waterfall images.', '2005-10-17 22:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791119, 245126, 40491, '<td valign="top">I used to live near the UP of Michigan... this is so reminiscent... you have captured a place so far away from the hustle and bustle of the city. The wide angle really does this justice.</td>', 'I used to live near the UP of Michigan... this is so reminiscent... you have captured a place so far away from the hustle and bustle of the city. The wide angle really does this justice.', '2005-10-17 22:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791121, 244778, 40819, '<td valign="top">Nice image of Jersey City NJ. I hate that giant building at the water''s edge, it blocks the view north from Ligerty State Park. Yuck. But nice sunset.</td>', 'Nice image of Jersey City NJ. I hate that giant building at the water''s edge, it blocks the view north from Ligerty State Park. Yuck. But nice sunset.', '2005-10-17 22:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791129, 244541, 40819, '<td valign="top">Baby you are getting good. I know who you are. Stole my idea, well you deserve a big number for this one, promise to show me the spot someday? And let''s get the PA to fix that burnt out red bulb. :) Nice job you are really getting good. If this isn''t who I think it is, oh am I embarrassed.</td>', 'Baby you are getting good. I know who you are. Stole my idea, well you deserve a big number for this one, promise to show me the spot someday? And let''s get the PA to fix that burnt out red bulb. :) Nice job you are really getting good. If this isn''t who I think it is, oh am I embarrassed.', '2005-10-17 22:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791130, 244422, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very Cool. Love the lighting.</td>', 'Very Cool. Love the lighting.', '2005-10-17 22:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791150, 244150, 44754, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus</td>', 'Looks out of focus', '2005-10-17 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791151, 243799, 18870, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I love it.  Do you have any out takes from the night you shot this?</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I love it.  Do you have any out takes from the night you shot this?', '2005-10-17 22:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791161, 245015, 40819, '<td valign="top">What''s with you and cloudy New York skys? 9</td>', 'What''s with you and cloudy New York skys? 9', '2005-10-17 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791200, 244976, 40819, '<td valign="top">It amazes me how some reflective images got mixed up in Wide Angle. I did the same thing, I hope you have another shot like this for reflections, it will score a ten. This is pretty close to a ten as well. Love it, I would have just not added the border. Be well and good luck.</td>', 'It amazes me how some reflective images got mixed up in Wide Angle. I did the same thing, I hope you have another shot like this for reflections, it will score a ten. This is pretty close to a ten as well. Love it, I would have just not added the border. Be well and good luck.', '2005-10-17 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791244, 245050, 30669, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  10</td>', 'I love this picture.  10', '2005-10-17 23:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791252, 245015, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very striking image.  Wonderful use of the ish-eye.  Nice composition with the 2 large buildings making a nice framing of the square.  I like the processing very much for an added dramatic impact.</td>', 'Very striking image.  Wonderful use of the ish-eye.  Nice composition with the 2 large buildings making a nice framing of the square.  I like the processing very much for an added dramatic impact.', '2005-10-17 23:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791254, 244978, 41522, '<td valign="top">Simplisic beauty.  I like the balance and the the vast elook of the space the wide angle view gives this shot.  The rom has depth with this view.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Simplisic beauty.  I like the balance and the the vast elook of the space the wide angle view gives this shot.  The rom has depth with this view.  Excellent work!', '2005-10-17 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791260, 244880, 41522, '<td valign="top">Despite the crop to give a pano look to this shot, it still stands as an outstanding photo.  The contrast f the white building against the dark environment is very nice.  Good work.</td>', 'Despite the crop to give a pano look to this shot, it still stands as an outstanding photo.  The contrast f the white building against the dark environment is very nice.  Good work.', '2005-10-17 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791269, 244714, 41522, '<td valign="top">Way cool an very creative.  I never would have thought of something like this!  The wide angle gives an unnatural length to the escalator which reminds me of how much I HATE being in malls  The human touch on the escalator adds to that feeing for me.  Excellent shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Way cool an very creative.  I never would have thought of something like this!  The wide angle gives an unnatural length to the escalator which reminds me of how much I HATE being in malls  The human touch on the escalator adds to that feeing for me.  Excellent shot.  Good luck.', '2005-10-17 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791271, 242588, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been a nice wide angle, but the resulting unfocused view doesn''t work for me.  JMO.</td>', 'I think this might have been a nice wide angle, but the resulting unfocused view doesn''t work for me.  JMO.', '2005-10-17 23:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791274, 245039, 41522, '<td valign="top">The results of the GTA GTG!!  Excellent wide angle view.  The contrast of the B&amp;W stripes against the colour realy is cool.  There are a couple of spots in this image that look strangly blurred (around the back feet, along the edges and top of the tree).  Is this blur from processing or captured in camera or wind?  At any rate, I really like the shot ... a good composition!</td>', 'The results of the GTA GTG!!  Excellent wide angle view.  The contrast of the B&W stripes against the colour realy is cool.  There are a couple of spots in this image that look strangly blurred (around the back feet, along the edges and top of the tree).  Is this blur from processing or captured in camera or wind?  At any rate, I really like the shot ... a good composition!', '2005-10-17 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791283, 244552, 41522, '<td valign="top">While the sunrays are nice in thisshot and the dried ground is a cool foreground, I think  like the other view of this scene within this challenge (titled The Storm) a littl better.  I think the other shot does a bit better job of showing the big sky view of the area.  JMO.</td>', 'While the sunrays are nice in thisshot and the dried ground is a cool foreground, I think  like the other view of this scene within this challenge (titled The Storm) a littl better.  I think the other shot does a bit better job of showing the big sky view of the area.  JMO.', '2005-10-17 23:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791289, 244803, 41522, '<td valign="top">A nice scene and some nice depth to the shot.  I would have liked a little better management of the dynamic range of the scene.  Perhaps a Grad ND filter would have helped to kep the clouds from being so bright.  JMO.</td>', 'A nice scene and some nice depth to the shot.  I would have liked a little better management of the dynamic range of the scene.  Perhaps a Grad ND filter would have helped to kep the clouds from being so bright.  JMO.', '2005-10-17 23:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791309, 244193, 38911, '<td valign="top">I find the architecture in this photo interesting.  By tilting your camera, I think you have actually taken away from the picture.  Its harder to look at.  Just my two cents.  Good luck in the competition. <br/>:o\ <br/> <br/></td>', 'I find the architecture in this photo interesting.  By tilting your camera, I think you have actually taken away from the picture.  Its harder to look at.  Just my two cents.  Good luck in the competition. :o\  ', '2005-10-17 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791315, 244852, 38911, '<td valign="top">I like what you have done with this picture.  Nice colours, nice composition, &amp; great idea!<br/>Good luck in the competition. <br/>:o)<br/></td>', 'I like what you have done with this picture.  Nice colours, nice composition, & great idea!Good luck in the competition. :o)', '2005-10-17 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
