(1791553, 245039, 13026, '<td valign="top">Hoho.  Nice zebra butt you got going there, Joey.  :)<br/>Looks like the GTG in Toronto paid off.  :)<br/>I''m loving the editing.</td>', 'Hoho.  Nice zebra butt you got going there, Joey.  :)Looks like the GTG in Toronto paid off.  :)I''m loving the editing.', '2005-10-18 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791595, 245095, 38818, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! I''m speechless...</td>', 'Outstanding! I''m speechless...', '2005-10-18 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791643, 243979, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really cool... and I think it really looks like an eye!! I''d be interested to see how the wide angle effected this shot''s outcome. Cool lighting and the blown out "pupil" is great.  Good luck!!</td>', 'This is really cool... and I think it really looks like an eye!! I''d be interested to see how the wide angle effected this shot''s outcome. Cool lighting and the blown out "pupil" is great.  Good luck!!', '2005-10-18 01:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791645, 245135, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is cool!  The distortion is really neat here... and the lighting is great :-)  this is a fun, interesting photo... Good luck!</td>', 'This is cool!  The distortion is really neat here... and the lighting is great :-)  this is a fun, interesting photo... Good luck!', '2005-10-18 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791647, 244618, 40718, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad there''s so much pixelation artifact on the diagonal lines.  I like the picture though, it is slightly off horizontal.</td>', 'It''s too bad there''s so much pixelation artifact on the diagonal lines.  I like the picture though, it is slightly off horizontal.', '2005-10-18 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791649, 245139, 4967, '<td valign="top">The curve of the water line lends itself well to the wide angle photo... I might have preferred the sand/rocks to maybe show more at the bottom of the photo?  but this is nice.</td>', 'The curve of the water line lends itself well to the wide angle photo... I might have preferred the sand/rocks to maybe show more at the bottom of the photo?  but this is nice.', '2005-10-18 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791651, 243157, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This composition is too centered, both horizontal and vertical.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This composition is too centered, both horizontal and vertical.', '2005-10-18 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791654, 244613, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as lending itself well to being a wide angle photo... because the interest is purely on the plane, especially because you have it situated almost dead center.  While I''m sure you took this with your wide angle setting/lens... I personally have been looking for things that are made better by the wide angle look.  Just my honest opinion.</td>', 'I don''t see this as lending itself well to being a wide angle photo... because the interest is purely on the plane, especially because you have it situated almost dead center.  While I''m sure you took this with your wide angle setting/lens... I personally have been looking for things that are made better by the wide angle look.  Just my honest opinion.', '2005-10-18 01:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791655, 244969, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good job in a difficult lighting situation... I love how close up you are to this guy... I almost want to step back so I don''t get his sweat on me!!</td>', 'Good job in a difficult lighting situation... I love how close up you are to this guy... I almost want to step back so I don''t get his sweat on me!!', '2005-10-18 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791656, 244964, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>The colors in this are great, but the composition is lacking a main subject for me to draw my attention in. Nice work on the scene though. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 The colors in this are great, but the composition is lacking a main subject for me to draw my attention in. Nice work on the scene though. Keep up the good work.', '2005-10-18 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791661, 244551, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Great work here. The exposure is really well done. How did you capture the stars without trails? I would love to know.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Great work here. The exposure is really well done. How did you capture the stars without trails? I would love to know.', '2005-10-18 01:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791667, 244969, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Interesting.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Interesting.', '2005-10-18 01:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
