(1791901, 244907, 20950, '<td valign="top">LOL! awesome idea</td>', 'LOL! awesome idea', '2005-10-18 03:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791905, 244916, 23891, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast, perfectly chosen black point, and nice framing. If anything, you were betrayed by the drab light that day (or time) but I still like the softness.</td>', 'Excellent contrast, perfectly chosen black point, and nice framing. If anything, you were betrayed by the drab light that day (or time) but I still like the softness.', '2005-10-18 03:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791909, 245160, 23891, '<td valign="top">I like it and gave it a high score (too early to say what score exactly; I go back and normalize everything at the end). Three nit picks: 1) There''s something at the bottom left that could have been cropped or cloned out. 2) For a B&amp;W, I would have liked to see a little less contrast and sharpening. 3) Well, nothing you can do about this most likely, but the hazy sky doesn''t make for a good background. Did you think about a duotone here, maybe with brown highlights?</td>', 'I like it and gave it a high score (too early to say what score exactly; I go back and normalize everything at the end). Three nit picks: 1) There''s something at the bottom left that could have been cropped or cloned out. 2) For a B&W, I would have liked to see a little less contrast and sharpening. 3) Well, nothing you can do about this most likely, but the hazy sky doesn''t make for a good background. Did you think about a duotone here, maybe with brown highlights?', '2005-10-18 03:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791911, 244015, 23891, '<td valign="top">Almost nothing to say here- exposure and contrast are perfect. Perhaps the framing isn''t ideal, but still very very nice.</td>', 'Almost nothing to say here- exposure and contrast are perfect. Perhaps the framing isn''t ideal, but still very very nice.', '2005-10-18 03:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791913, 243972, 23891, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why exactly, but this well-executed shot isn''t doing much for me. I think it''s because there''s no context. e.g. a woman inspecting one of the apple''s, or the vendor.</td>', 'I don''t know why exactly, but this well-executed shot isn''t doing much for me. I think it''s because there''s no context. e.g. a woman inspecting one of the apple''s, or the vendor.', '2005-10-18 03:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791915, 243795, 23891, '<td valign="top">This is one for the "how the f**k did they do that?" file. My pick to win.</td>', 'This is one for the "how the f**k did they do that?" file. My pick to win.', '2005-10-18 03:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791917, 243554, 23891, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a building! Unfortunately the flares are killing you here. Did you use a hood? In addition to the obvious flaring, they''ve caused a slight noticeable cast, which could have been corrected in post.</td>', 'Wow, what a building! Unfortunately the flares are killing you here. Did you use a hood? In addition to the obvious flaring, they''ve caused a slight noticeable cast, which could have been corrected in post.', '2005-10-18 03:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791920, 244998, 23891, '<td valign="top">Very cool. High score from me. Suggestion: less floor, more ceiling, and tone down the billowy lights in areas besides the windows and hanging lights.</td>', 'Very cool. High score from me. Suggestion: less floor, more ceiling, and tone down the billowy lights in areas besides the windows and hanging lights.', '2005-10-18 03:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791921, 244941, 23891, '<td valign="top">Something''s off with the color temperature here. Too cool I think. Either that or there''s a color cast. Also, the framing would have been better shifted to the left IMO.</td>', 'Something''s off with the color temperature here. Too cool I think. Either that or there''s a color cast. Also, the framing would have been better shifted to the left IMO.', '2005-10-18 04:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791924, 245026, 23891, '<td valign="top">Is the black background for real or did you just cut that out? It doesn''t really do it for me.</td>', 'Is the black background for real or did you just cut that out? It doesn''t really do it for me.', '2005-10-18 04:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791925, 244465, 23891, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Perhaps more contrast through the middle.</td>', 'Very nice. Perhaps more contrast through the middle.', '2005-10-18 04:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791928, 245095, 23891, '<td valign="top">Awesome.</td>', 'Awesome.', '2005-10-18 04:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791935, 243808, 23891, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Some relatively small nitpicks: 1) I like the framing, except the close up pavement dominates too much. Perhaps instead of resting the camera directly on the road, prop it up on a bag. 2) I''d say you went a little too far with the selective editing on the trees to the right. The halos and tonal mismatch with the sky are distracting. 3) Too bad about the flare. Did you use a hood?</td>', 'I really like this shot. Some relatively small nitpicks: 1) I like the framing, except the close up pavement dominates too much. Perhaps instead of resting the camera directly on the road, prop it up on a bag. 2) I''d say you went a little too far with the selective editing on the trees to the right. The halos and tonal mismatch with the sky are distracting. 3) Too bad about the flare. Did you use a hood?', '2005-10-18 04:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791937, 245039, 23891, '<td valign="top">Who woulda thought a zebra''s arse could be so gorgeous? Seriously, this is a beaut.</td>', 'Who woulda thought a zebra''s arse could be so gorgeous? Seriously, this is a beaut.', '2005-10-18 04:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791939, 244909, 23891, '<td valign="top">Nice choice not to bring the black point up and I love the duotone. Am I crazy or is the frame thicker at the bottom than the top?</td>', 'Nice choice not to bring the black point up and I love the duotone. Am I crazy or is the frame thicker at the bottom than the top?', '2005-10-18 04:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791941, 244338, 23891, '<td valign="top">Tricky exposure! You definitely pulled it off. Nice framing and interesting setup. Great shot.</td>', 'Tricky exposure! You definitely pulled it off. Nice framing and interesting setup. Great shot.', '2005-10-18 04:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791944, 245027, 23891, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The contrast is a little overboard IMO.</td>', 'Very cool. The contrast is a little overboard IMO.', '2005-10-18 04:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791946, 243153, 23891, '<td valign="top">Too good. Just. Too. Good.</td>', 'Too good. Just. Too. Good.', '2005-10-18 04:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791949, 243979, 23891, '<td valign="top">Shooting straight into that small cylinder of bright light is tricky. The resulting flare seems to have tinted some of the neutrals.</td>', 'Shooting straight into that small cylinder of bright light is tricky. The resulting flare seems to have tinted some of the neutrals.', '2005-10-18 04:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791950, 243799, 23891, '<td valign="top">Nothing to say but "Wow".</td>', 'Nothing to say but "Wow".', '2005-10-18 04:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791955, 245139, 45141, '<td valign="top">The clouds are surreal... I love it</td>', 'The clouds are surreal... I love it', '2005-10-18 04:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791962, 242588, 45141, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft.</td>', 'Seems a little soft.', '2005-10-18 04:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791964, 245142, 16053, '<td valign="top">Very "wide angle" but not so very interesting subject. Good technique although.</td>', 'Very "wide angle" but not so very interesting subject. Good technique although.', '2005-10-18 04:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791966, 244452, 16053, '<td valign="top">Very good subject. Probably others might been tempted to let the sky rull the composition, but I think is a great job with very good meeting of the theme.</td>', 'Very good subject. Probably others might been tempted to let the sky rull the composition, but I think is a great job with very good meeting of the theme.', '2005-10-18 04:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791968, 244880, 16053, '<td valign="top">Excellent lightning. Excellent wideness. One of my favourites so far. Didn''t mind to see this hanging on a wall.</td>', 'Excellent lightning. Excellent wideness. One of my favourites so far. Didn''t mind to see this hanging on a wall.', '2005-10-18 04:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
