(1792061, 244453, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good fun spirit, but don''t seem like a wide angle shoot. Not because of the theme, but because of perspective. In wide angle shoot s the background should contain a lot more things in a smaller porportion wuth the main/closer subject. Hope it helps.</td>', 'Good fun spirit, but don''t seem like a wide angle shoot. Not because of the theme, but because of perspective. In wide angle shoot s the background should contain a lot more things in a smaller porportion wuth the main/closer subject. Hope it helps.', '2005-10-18 06:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
