(1792425, 245148, 17446, '<td valign="top">The colors are excellent!  The white border looks good with this shot.  It may have been better to have not centered the boats so much.  This is still a very good picture. 9.</td>', 'The colors are excellent!  The white border looks good with this shot.  It may have been better to have not centered the boats so much.  This is still a very good picture. 9.', '2005-10-18 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
