(1792427, 242887, 17446, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Nice contrast between the white and blues.  It looks good how the blue sky fades from a deeper shade at the top to a lighter color at the bottom.  9.</td>', 'Good picture.  Nice contrast between the white and blues.  It looks good how the blue sky fades from a deeper shade at the top to a lighter color at the bottom.  9.', '2005-10-18 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
