(1792833, 244396, 26542, '<td valign="top">This is one of my personal favs fromt he challenge.  Wonderful execution of a difficult lighting situation.  Kudos for that.  Plus its just an excellent example of good composition and a wonderful capture of some truly magnificent lighting.  Very well done.  A 10 from me.<br/> <br/>Good Luck! =)</td>', 'This is one of my personal favs fromt he challenge.  Wonderful execution of a difficult lighting situation.  Kudos for that.  Plus its just an excellent example of good composition and a wonderful capture of some truly magnificent lighting.  Very well done.  A 10 from me. Good Luck! =)', '2005-10-18 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792837, 244390, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice work capturing a wide angle with what may be limited means.  The green is a little overpowering in this shot, but I do like the symettry of the reflection and the garden.</td>', 'Nice work capturing a wide angle with what may be limited means.  The green is a little overpowering in this shot, but I do like the symettry of the reflection and the garden.', '2005-10-18 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792841, 244541, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.  Nice night shot.  I am partial to that kind of star glow and it looks lovely here.  The slight tilt of the tree at the bottom left is a little disconcerting to me, but it adds to the off balance feel of the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.  Nice night shot.  I am partial to that kind of star glow and it looks lovely here.  The slight tilt of the tree at the bottom left is a little disconcerting to me, but it adds to the off balance feel of the shot.', '2005-10-18 14:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792844, 244708, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve picked a vertical wide-angle shot.  I like the feeling that we are in the physical space of the bar and we can see from the ceiling to the floor in the foreground.  It make the men seem further away and their conversation more mysterious and secretive.  I don''t know if I would have chosen this slight yellowish cast for this picture.</td>', 'I like that you''ve picked a vertical wide-angle shot.  I like the feeling that we are in the physical space of the bar and we can see from the ceiling to the floor in the foreground.  It make the men seem further away and their conversation more mysterious and secretive.  I don''t know if I would have chosen this slight yellowish cast for this picture.', '2005-10-18 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792848, 243929, 37103, '<td valign="top">This does not feel like a particularly wide angle shot, but the lighting on these leaves is beautiful.  Very nice image.</td>', 'This does not feel like a particularly wide angle shot, but the lighting on these leaves is beautiful.  Very nice image.', '2005-10-18 14:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792862, 244338, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very unearthly image.  It looks like a church or an auditorium.  But at first glance it looks like something from a science fiction or future world.  Especially with that man all in black.  Very cool image.</td>', 'Very unearthly image.  It looks like a church or an auditorium.  But at first glance it looks like something from a science fiction or future world.  Especially with that man all in black.  Very cool image.', '2005-10-18 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
