(1792925, 245126, 26255, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!! I love the colors!!!!</td>', 'WOW!!!! I love the colors!!!!', '2005-10-18 14:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792926, 244866, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea you have going on here. IMHO I think your shot would be more dramatic if the color continued down the path of the road. This would help draw the viewer into the shot and strengthen the depth of field in the shot. Beautiful colors and I''m sure the color version is drop dead gorgeous! I give this a 7.</td>', 'I really like the idea you have going on here. IMHO I think your shot would be more dramatic if the color continued down the path of the road. This would help draw the viewer into the shot and strengthen the depth of field in the shot. Beautiful colors and I''m sure the color version is drop dead gorgeous! I give this a 7.', '2005-10-18 14:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792927, 243795, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and interesting composition.  I love seeing photographs of this caliber with difficult technical elements to them.  Kudos for pushing the envelope a bit. =)  a 9 from me</td>', 'Very creative idea and interesting composition.  I love seeing photographs of this caliber with difficult technical elements to them.  Kudos for pushing the envelope a bit. =)  a 9 from me', '2005-10-18 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792930, 245150, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very very well done.  I really enjoy the depth of this photograph and the colors just pop out of the image.  A 9 from me</td>', 'Very very well done.  I really enjoy the depth of this photograph and the colors just pop out of the image.  A 9 from me', '2005-10-18 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792933, 244667, 26255, '<td valign="top">The image seems slightly tilted.  The shadow on the right is a bit of a distraction.  I think the composition is good overall!</td>', 'The image seems slightly tilted.  The shadow on the right is a bit of a distraction.  I think the composition is good overall!', '2005-10-18 14:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792935, 242691, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I miss Chicago.  Lovely image. a 9</td>', 'Very nice!  I miss Chicago.  Lovely image. a 9', '2005-10-18 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792936, 244465, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very nice...lots of depth and beautiful colors.  A 9</td>', 'Very nice...lots of depth and beautiful colors.  A 9', '2005-10-18 14:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792939, 244537, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very nice image...my daughters personal fav.  Interesting composition choice for this challenge...but it is quite ingenious.  Using the fence posts to give the image a natural wide crop...very ingenious indeed.  a 9 from me =)</td>', 'Very nice image...my daughters personal fav.  Interesting composition choice for this challenge...but it is quite ingenious.  Using the fence posts to give the image a natural wide crop...very ingenious indeed.  a 9 from me =)', '2005-10-18 14:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792942, 244286, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very soft and deep feeling image.  I would LOVE to see a high res version of this shot.  a 9</td>', 'Very soft and deep feeling image.  I would LOVE to see a high res version of this shot.  a 9', '2005-10-18 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792947, 244856, 26542, '<td valign="top">Tuff call on this for me.<br/> <br/>First I love the image...very classic...nice depth and wonderful and fresh composition.  It also had to have been a difficult shot to pull off in digital due to the wide light range this scene has.  Kudos for pulling that one off.  <br/> <br/>The only thing I didnt like about this...is that it feels a bit over saturated to me.  its a lil too vivid...almost surreal.  <br/> <br/>A 9</td>', 'Tuff call on this for me. First I love the image...very classic...nice depth and wonderful and fresh composition.  It also had to have been a difficult shot to pull off in digital due to the wide light range this scene has.  Kudos for pulling that one off.   The only thing I didnt like about this...is that it feels a bit over saturated to me.  its a lil too vivid...almost surreal.   A 9', '2005-10-18 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792949, 245037, 39349, '<td valign="top">Good colors but I think I would have liked to see a different perspective on this shot. Maybe getting lower to the pumpkins and getting it from a different angle? You DOF is right on I give this a 6.</td>', 'Good colors but I think I would have liked to see a different perspective on this shot. Maybe getting lower to the pumpkins and getting it from a different angle? You DOF is right on I give this a 6.', '2005-10-18 14:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792953, 244995, 26542, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...simply beautiful.  Lots of depth and coolness to this. and the processing work on the sky is stunning.  I would like to see a lil more work done on the joining like tween the sky and ground...it kinda pops out at me as this is something I personally struggle with in dynamically light scenes like this and the post processing they require.  Still though...a 9 from me. =)</td>', 'Beautiful...simply beautiful.  Lots of depth and coolness to this. and the processing work on the sky is stunning.  I would like to see a lil more work done on the joining like tween the sky and ground...it kinda pops out at me as this is something I personally struggle with in dynamically light scenes like this and the post processing they require.  Still though...a 9 from me. =)', '2005-10-18 14:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792955, 244691, 26542, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting</td>', 'Lovely lighting', '2005-10-18 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792957, 244484, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very softy and elegant image.  It feels HUGE to me...nicely done.  A 9</td>', 'Very softy and elegant image.  It feels HUGE to me...nicely done.  A 9', '2005-10-18 14:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792962, 245050, 26542, '<td valign="top">What a stunning sky you captured here.  This image feels HUGE...so much depth to this...very very well done.  It also was not a simple capture due to the dynamic range of light so kudos for technical expertise here as well.  A 10 from me =)</td>', 'What a stunning sky you captured here.  This image feels HUGE...so much depth to this...very very well done.  It also was not a simple capture due to the dynamic range of light so kudos for technical expertise here as well.  A 10 from me =)', '2005-10-18 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792963, 245101, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I love the B&amp;W treatment...glorious greyscale in this.  Very well executed.  A 9</td>', 'Very nice...I love the B&W treatment...glorious greyscale in this.  Very well executed.  A 9', '2005-10-18 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792965, 242946, 26542, '<td valign="top">lovely image.  It seems a bit overly saturated for my taste...but its still stunning.  A 9</td>', 'lovely image.  It seems a bit overly saturated for my taste...but its still stunning.  A 9', '2005-10-18 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792968, 244916, 26542, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image...superb composition.  I do hope you will revisit this site/angle/composition when you have a lil bit more to work with sky wise.  Still a lovely photograph.  A 9</td>', 'Beautiful image...superb composition.  I do hope you will revisit this site/angle/composition when you have a lil bit more to work with sky wise.  Still a lovely photograph.  A 9', '2005-10-18 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792973, 245115, 26542, '<td valign="top">You see alot of these soft water time exposures...I have yet to see one from an angle such as this.  Props for taking a very classic photograph and putting a fresh spin on it.  One of the few from this challenge that I personally would like to hang in my home...for what its worth. =)  I would LOVE to see a high res version of this.  A 10 from me</td>', 'You see alot of these soft water time exposures...I have yet to see one from an angle such as this.  Props for taking a very classic photograph and putting a fresh spin on it.  One of the few from this challenge that I personally would like to hang in my home...for what its worth. =)  I would LOVE to see a high res version of this.  A 10 from me', '2005-10-18 15:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792975, 245031, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Seems to lack sharpness.  Perhaps a little lower viewpoint including more space to the right could improove the shot.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Seems to lack sharpness.  Perhaps a little lower viewpoint including more space to the right could improove the shot.', '2005-10-18 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792976, 244974, 26542, '<td valign="top">very interesting and inventive processing.  A 9 from me</td>', 'very interesting and inventive processing.  A 9 from me', '2005-10-18 15:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792977, 244909, 38234, '<td valign="top">this is just stunning - an 8 from me</td>', 'this is just stunning - an 8 from me', '2005-10-18 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792979, 245015, 26542, '<td valign="top">Stunning...truly.  Gotta LOVE those fish eyes. =)  Very well executed and I really like the piost processing you have done here.  Very well done.</td>', 'Stunning...truly.  Gotta LOVE those fish eyes. =)  Very well executed and I really like the piost processing you have done here.  Very well done.', '2005-10-18 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792980, 245135, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  A 9</td>', 'Very nicely done.  A 9', '2005-10-18 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792981, 244673, 38234, '<td valign="top">cool image - creatively composed</td>', 'cool image - creatively composed', '2005-10-18 15:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792982, 245126, 26542, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph...and technically very well done.  It cant have been the simpliest shot to expose properly =)  A 9</td>', 'Lovely photograph...and technically very well done.  It cant have been the simpliest shot to expose properly =)  A 9', '2005-10-18 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
