(1792986, 244626, 26542, '<td valign="top">Classic...superb composition...excellent technical delivery.  Very well done.  I am giving it a 9 almost purely on its technical merits...its lacks a il something...and honestly I dont know what it is.  It just doesnt pop for me.  Still...its an excellent photograph...one to be proud of.</td>', 'Classic...superb composition...excellent technical delivery.  Very well done.  I am giving it a 9 almost purely on its technical merits...its lacks a il something...and honestly I dont know what it is.  It just doesnt pop for me.  Still...its an excellent photograph...one to be proud of.', '2005-10-18 15:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792988, 243979, 39349, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2005-10-18 15:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792990, 245021, 26542, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a recent trip to Tucson. =)<br/> <br/>Lovely choice of composition...the road really leads you into the photograph and adds tremendous depth to the image.  Excellent job capturing such a dynamically litght scene.  a 9 from me.</td>', 'Reminds me of a recent trip to Tucson. =) Lovely choice of composition...the road really leads you into the photograph and adds tremendous depth to the image.  Excellent job capturing such a dynamically litght scene.  a 9 from me.', '2005-10-18 15:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1792996, 245091, 26542, '<td valign="top">This one really caught my eye.  I am not super blown away with the lighting or the technical aspects of this capture...hence the 9...but the composition and sheer originality is just stellar.  WONDERFUL idea... =)</td>', 'This one really caught my eye.  I am not super blown away with the lighting or the technical aspects of this capture...hence the 9...but the composition and sheer originality is just stellar.  WONDERFUL idea... =)', '2005-10-18 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793001, 244309, 26542, '<td valign="top">I am having flashbacks of Easy Rider. =)<br/> <br/>Wonderful image...superb composition.  I personally dont care for the muddy road...or what appears to be a muddy road on the right...hance the 9.  I would love to see you revisit this shot once that dries up =)</td>', 'I am having flashbacks of Easy Rider. =) Wonderful image...superb composition.  I personally dont care for the muddy road...or what appears to be a muddy road on the right...hance the 9.  I would love to see you revisit this shot once that dries up =)', '2005-10-18 15:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793002, 242884, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very original idea...lots of depth... a 9</td>', 'Very original idea...lots of depth... a 9', '2005-10-18 15:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793006, 244708, 26542, '<td valign="top">Very very cool photograph and NOT what I was expecting to see in the Wide Angle challenge.  Very original idea and I think it fits very well.  Excellent capture with the lighting...there is alot of mood in this photograph...one, had I taken it, I would be very proud of.  A 9 from me.</td>', 'Very very cool photograph and NOT what I was expecting to see in the Wide Angle challenge.  Very original idea and I think it fits very well.  Excellent capture with the lighting...there is alot of mood in this photograph...one, had I taken it, I would be very proud of.  A 9 from me.', '2005-10-18 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793030, 244338, 38911, '<td valign="top">This picture has  interesting cold hard lines contrasted by the man walking in from the light. It is well represented in B&amp;W.  Nice work! :&gt;)</td>', 'This picture has  interesting cold hard lines contrasted by the man walking in from the light. It is well represented in B&W.  Nice work! :>)', '2005-10-18 15:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793051, 243799, 38911, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view and wicked colours here!  I find this picture very appealing.  Nice work! <br/>8o)<br/></td>', 'Nice point of view and wicked colours here!  I find this picture very appealing.  Nice work! 8o)', '2005-10-18 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
