(1793066, 243473, 4967, '<td valign="top">G-d I love fish eye shots!!  they are SO awesome :-D  I like your choice to go in black and white... looks old fashioned.  Good luck.</td>', 'G-d I love fish eye shots!!  they are SO awesome :-D  I like your choice to go in black and white... looks old fashioned.  Good luck.', '2005-10-18 15:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1793074, 244338, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot... good use of light!  Great choice to use black and white.  I like the symmetry here :-) and the way that the wide angle gives it a slight roundness.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot... good use of light!  Great choice to use black and white.  I like the symmetry here :-) and the way that the wide angle gives it a slight roundness.  Good luck!', '2005-10-18 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
