(1793751, 245101, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very nice!  I like it a lot.  The grasses in the foreground, the clouds, the dappled light on the mountainsides, and the house with its little black windows.  Great photo.  And if anyone comments that the house should be positioned more to the left to comply with the rule of thirds, I will personally kick their ass ;)</td>', 'Very, very, very nice!  I like it a lot.  The grasses in the foreground, the clouds, the dappled light on the mountainsides, and the house with its little black windows.  Great photo.  And if anyone comments that the house should be positioned more to the left to comply with the rule of thirds, I will personally kick their ass ;)', '2005-10-18 21:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
