(1794017, 243554, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful building. While I like the rainbow rays in the lower right corner, I do find the sun flares a bit distracting. Nice shadow too.</td>', 'What a beautiful building. While I like the rainbow rays in the lower right corner, I do find the sun flares a bit distracting. Nice shadow too.', '2005-10-18 23:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
