(1794023, 243465, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice wide angle, but for me, your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in the challenge. I find the elements behind the mailboxes a bit distracting.</td>', 'A nice wide angle, but for me, your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in the challenge. I find the elements behind the mailboxes a bit distracting.', '2005-10-18 23:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
