(1794032, 244426, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute photo to treasure in years to come. I like the lighting. I might have cropped out just a bit more of the tree(?) on the right edge, but still, a nice photo.</td>', 'Cute photo to treasure in years to come. I like the lighting. I might have cropped out just a bit more of the tree(?) on the right edge, but still, a nice photo.', '2005-10-18 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
