(1796137, 245096, 42005, '<td valign="top">OH NO...then it is my head that is tilted?<br/>I really love this photograph.  The clouds are so serene both in the sky and the building, and the building is CRISP and clean.   Great color too.  Love the various shades of blue in the windows.  Thanks so much for bringing us this shot!</td>', 'OH NO...then it is my head that is tilted?I really love this photograph.  The clouds are so serene both in the sky and the building, and the building is CRISP and clean.   Great color too.  Love the various shades of blue in the windows.  Thanks so much for bringing us this shot!', '2005-10-19 17:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1796152, 244912, 42005, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo.  It amazes me.  The dark dark sky and the clear line of the boats...the wondering what they are doing there and if they will ever be move.....the mystery of the light in the upper left corner and the puddle of water near the farthest boat.  I think the clarity of the photo and oblique title along with the mysterious things (at least for one who does not live near water) all work to make this very special.  10</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo.  It amazes me.  The dark dark sky and the clear line of the boats...the wondering what they are doing there and if they will ever be move.....the mystery of the light in the upper left corner and the puddle of water near the farthest boat.  I think the clarity of the photo and oblique title along with the mysterious things (at least for one who does not live near water) all work to make this very special.  10', '2005-10-19 17:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1796168, 244856, 42005, '<td valign="top">I love the ''realness'' of this.  I can almost hear the crunch of the leaves and smell autumn in the air.  Besides..it is a well done photograph. I am sure the farm owner would love this framed.</td>', 'I love the ''realness'' of this.  I can almost hear the crunch of the leaves and smell autumn in the air.  Besides..it is a well done photograph. I am sure the farm owner would love this framed.', '2005-10-19 17:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
