(1796186, 243523, 42005, '<td valign="top">I like the clean line of the barn roof and the dark shadows near the rather agandoned door as well as the variety of greens.  I see why you included the tree on the right but it almost feels too menacing. 9  PS. Thanks for not doing it in sepia or black and white.</td>', 'I like the clean line of the barn roof and the dark shadows near the rather agandoned door as well as the variety of greens.  I see why you included the tree on the right but it almost feels too menacing. 9  PS. Thanks for not doing it in sepia or black and white.', '2005-10-19 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
