(1797672, 244440, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2 - The colors are all exposed well, but the shadows along the right bank are a little too dark.<br/>Composition: 1/2 - The leading lines are effectiev, but the horizon centered in the photo could be improved, and the top part of the tree in the lower section is distracting.<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2 - There is a spot on the upper right corner that should have been removed.<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 - It just seems a bit too plain.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2 - The colors are all exposed well, but the shadows along the right bank are a little too dark.Composition: 1/2 - The leading lines are effectiev, but the horizon centered in the photo could be improved, and the top part of the tree in the lower section is distracting.Photo Quality: 1/2 - There is a spot on the upper right corner that should have been removed.My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 - It just seems a bit too plain.', '2005-10-20 01:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797714, 245015, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool processing on this shot. I think it really goes well with the fisheye effect. Has a neat feel. Very dramatic. Nice detail. Great job.</td>', 'Cool processing on this shot. I think it really goes well with the fisheye effect. Has a neat feel. Very dramatic. Nice detail. Great job.', '2005-10-20 02:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
