(1797725, 244075, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting pov here. Nice use of leading lines. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting pov here. Nice use of leading lines. Good job.', '2005-10-20 02:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797729, 245139, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, and good compositionally. I''m not sure if it''s the editing, or the lighting at the time, but this has a very ''harsh'' feeling that doesn''t seem to fit the subject. Just my opinion though, maybe that is what you are after?</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, and good compositionally. I''m not sure if it''s the editing, or the lighting at the time, but this has a very ''harsh'' feeling that doesn''t seem to fit the subject. Just my opinion though, maybe that is what you are after?', '2005-10-20 02:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797733, 245164, 19831, '<td valign="top">Night shots are difficult. This seems like maybe it is slightly overexposed. It is hard to pick out any detail, and the lights are blown out some. It took a minute to see that this is a line of buses. Cool idea. I''m afraid many may not see it in the brief seconds that they view the photos in the challenges.</td>', 'Night shots are difficult. This seems like maybe it is slightly overexposed. It is hard to pick out any detail, and the lights are blown out some. It took a minute to see that this is a line of buses. Cool idea. I''m afraid many may not see it in the brief seconds that they view the photos in the challenges.', '2005-10-20 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797734, 244613, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Seems like focus could maybe be a little sharper, not very good detail present, especially in the darker areas. Perhaps some tweaking in levels could enhance the image? I have the feeling that this may be a case where the centered composition may not be as strong as if the plane were framed toward the right edge of the shot.</td>', 'Cool idea. Seems like focus could maybe be a little sharper, not very good detail present, especially in the darker areas. Perhaps some tweaking in levels could enhance the image? I have the feeling that this may be a case where the centered composition may not be as strong as if the plane were framed toward the right edge of the shot.', '2005-10-20 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797741, 244052, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. It seems that the focal point is served by the point on the horizon where the clouds are coming together, but it doesn''t feel like a strong anchor to me. I find my eye easily wandering off over the photo looking for a stronger point of interest.</td>', 'Cool idea. It seems that the focal point is served by the point on the horizon where the clouds are coming together, but it doesn''t feel like a strong anchor to me. I find my eye easily wandering off over the photo looking for a stronger point of interest.', '2005-10-20 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1797748, 244543, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good crowd shot. You''ve captured  and brought attention to the girl well, how when everyone is clambering for candy, she is going against the group and looking up at something else. Makes me want to know what it is that has grabbed her attention when there is all that candy to be had :-) Well done.</td>', 'A good crowd shot. You''ve captured  and brought attention to the girl well, how when everyone is clambering for candy, she is going against the group and looking up at something else. Makes me want to know what it is that has grabbed her attention when there is all that candy to be had :-) Well done.', '2005-10-20 02:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
