(1799330, 243153, 40245, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Pleadies very distinct. Only quibble is light a bottom left. Hopefully you have details posted on the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Pleadies very distinct. Only quibble is light a bottom left. Hopefully you have details posted on the shot.', '2005-10-20 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
