(1799352, 244050, 4767, '<td valign="top">Is that a mud flat?  The sepia effect is great on the sky, but it does make the foreground look as though you could sink to your hips in it.... dramatic and effective shot.</td>', 'Is that a mud flat?  The sepia effect is great on the sky, but it does make the foreground look as though you could sink to your hips in it.... dramatic and effective shot.', '2005-10-20 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
