(1799650, 245006, 17507, '<td valign="top">great DOF and sharpness. the splash of red on the left is a nice touch. the sky is a bit too cyan + saturated for me.</td>', 'great DOF and sharpness. the splash of red on the left is a nice touch. the sky is a bit too cyan + saturated for me.', '2005-10-20 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799654, 243972, 17507, '<td valign="top">I feel like a lower angle would have done a better job of illustrating "wide angle"</td>', 'I feel like a lower angle would have done a better job of illustrating "wide angle"', '2005-10-20 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799659, 244543, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what a scene! great use of the wide angle to show the action.</td>', 'wow, what a scene! great use of the wide angle to show the action.', '2005-10-20 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799660, 244446, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, oversharpening like AHHH!H!!!</td>', 'wow, oversharpening like AHHH!H!!!', '2005-10-20 22:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799663, 244708, 17507, '<td valign="top">I do not understand the title</td>', 'I do not understand the title', '2005-10-20 22:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799734, 243153, 10275, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image. Great sillouhette. Sky looks very realistic and the photographer ads nice point of interest. The only suggestion - I would have cloned out the reddish glow in the lower left corner. I wish you win ribbon.</td>', 'Spectacular image. Great sillouhette. Sky looks very realistic and the photographer ads nice point of interest. The only suggestion - I would have cloned out the reddish glow in the lower left corner. I wish you win ribbon.', '2005-10-20 22:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799745, 242946, 10275, '<td valign="top">The colours and clarity are just superb. Great exposure and balance. Your shadows are getting almost black, which ads a great contrast between the edge of the water and the sunlit treeline.</td>', 'The colours and clarity are just superb. Great exposure and balance. Your shadows are getting almost black, which ads a great contrast between the edge of the water and the sunlit treeline.', '2005-10-20 22:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799749, 243807, 10275, '<td valign="top">Love the Orton effect (the mistyness)... The colours are a bit on the cooler side (your yellow tones are lemony), but it''s a great image indeed.</td>', 'Love the Orton effect (the mistyness)... The colours are a bit on the cooler side (your yellow tones are lemony), but it''s a great image indeed.', '2005-10-20 22:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799757, 242887, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract shapes. Great lines leading your eyes around the image. Colours nice and clean. Very nice and carefully thought up composition.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract shapes. Great lines leading your eyes around the image. Colours nice and clean. Very nice and carefully thought up composition.', '2005-10-20 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799765, 242741, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel colours and textured water dropplets. The complimentary colours make this image even more appealing. The only little thing I would have cropped off a bit more of the black corner on the right side. That way the tower''s circular shape would be more off center as well. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Lovely pastel colours and textured water dropplets. The complimentary colours make this image even more appealing. The only little thing I would have cropped off a bit more of the black corner on the right side. That way the tower''s circular shape would be more off center as well. Beautiful photo.', '2005-10-20 22:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799766, 243304, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, poetry-like colours. The image evokes feelings of tranquility. But the composition is a bit confusing. The front boat crosses most of the more interesting scenery. Perhaps shooting from a different angle or moving beyond the front boat would have made difference. But the image is still gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautiful, poetry-like colours. The image evokes feelings of tranquility. But the composition is a bit confusing. The front boat crosses most of the more interesting scenery. Perhaps shooting from a different angle or moving beyond the front boat would have made difference. But the image is still gorgeous.', '2005-10-20 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799774, 244866, 10275, '<td valign="top">Truly a dream-like feeling this image evokes. You did nice job with the colour transition, but the sharpening-blurring is a bit off. My eyes are looking around the image for something to rest on - a point of focus (like a sharp branch or semething).</td>', 'Truly a dream-like feeling this image evokes. You did nice job with the colour transition, but the sharpening-blurring is a bit off. My eyes are looking around the image for something to rest on - a point of focus (like a sharp branch or semething).', '2005-10-20 22:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799778, 244714, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great symetry and nice indoor colours. I know this is not your fault, but I don''t like the "moire" pattern the forgroun makes, it distracts a bit. The guy in the image is also not too much appealing. But otherwise well done.</td>', 'Great symetry and nice indoor colours. I know this is not your fault, but I don''t like the "moire" pattern the forgroun makes, it distracts a bit. The guy in the image is also not too much appealing. But otherwise well done.', '2005-10-20 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799780, 243979, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wow, very very abstract. It''s amazing that thi is an architectural shot. It truly looks like an eye, including some pretty sharp lashes... The blue is a nice touch. I would have toned the colours toward warmer yellow though to compliment the blue point. Still love it.</td>', 'Wow, very very abstract. It''s amazing that thi is an architectural shot. It truly looks like an eye, including some pretty sharp lashes... The blue is a nice touch. I would have toned the colours toward warmer yellow though to compliment the blue point. Still love it.', '2005-10-20 22:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799788, 243979, 17203, '<td valign="top">A very good photo in its own right, but the title makes it great. Nice play on words. ;-)</td>', 'A very good photo in its own right, but the title makes it great. Nice play on words. ;-)', '2005-10-20 22:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799790, 245009, 10275, '<td valign="top">This image makes my heart sing. I feel like walking into it. Great scene. You have captured the colours beautifully. The only minor adjustment you could have made is to make the right dark area a bit brighter - it takes your eyes away from the colours.</td>', 'This image makes my heart sing. I feel like walking into it. Great scene. You have captured the colours beautifully. The only minor adjustment you could have made is to make the right dark area a bit brighter - it takes your eyes away from the colours.', '2005-10-20 22:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799828, 244543, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wide angle doesn''t mean creating a mish mash of an image. The hands are really in a way of seeing some of the expressions in the faces of people around. Perhaps better timing of your shot and better composition would have made this into otherwise memorable picture.</td>', 'Wide angle doesn''t mean creating a mish mash of an image. The hands are really in a way of seeing some of the expressions in the faces of people around. Perhaps better timing of your shot and better composition would have made this into otherwise memorable picture.', '2005-10-20 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799852, 245128, 10275, '<td valign="top">The boy''s expression is priceless. It leads your eyes directly into his. The background takes away from the image though. It''s a bit messy. You could have clone out few of the brightest spots. Colours are really nice.</td>', 'The boy''s expression is priceless. It leads your eyes directly into his. The background takes away from the image though. It''s a bit messy. You could have clone out few of the brightest spots. Colours are really nice.', '2005-10-20 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799859, 243705, 10275, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very interesting photo. When you shoot scenes with busy foreground, make sure that your foreground is in focus, because that''s what the viewers eyes see first. Also the tree is in dead centre, which makes the image a bit statick. Perhaps moving around a bit exploring different angles and views could improve the over all scene.</td>', 'This could have been a very interesting photo. When you shoot scenes with busy foreground, make sure that your foreground is in focus, because that''s what the viewers eyes see first. Also the tree is in dead centre, which makes the image a bit statick. Perhaps moving around a bit exploring different angles and views could improve the over all scene.', '2005-10-20 22:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799861, 245115, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective from this low angle, and the swirling water creates a nice visual flow. A little on the dark side- I suspect a lighter midtone and saturation might liven it up with the green and orange foliage at the top. The two leaves in the water make a good counterpoint, and an extra color boost there would have been a nice touch, too.</td>', 'Very cool perspective from this low angle, and the swirling water creates a nice visual flow. A little on the dark side- I suspect a lighter midtone and saturation might liven it up with the green and orange foliage at the top. The two leaves in the water make a good counterpoint, and an extra color boost there would have been a nice touch, too.', '2005-10-20 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799864, 244907, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting snapshot. I like his eyes being seen through the mesh. The lights in the background are too much and take your eyes away from the person.</td>', 'Interesting snapshot. I like his eyes being seen through the mesh. The lights in the background are too much and take your eyes away from the person.', '2005-10-20 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799871, 244058, 10275, '<td valign="top">I know you were trying for the widest angle possible, but excluding the glaring lamps could have made the image into better one. The lights totally overpower the rest of the delicate structure of the photo.</td>', 'I know you were trying for the widest angle possible, but excluding the glaring lamps could have made the image into better one. The lights totally overpower the rest of the delicate structure of the photo.', '2005-10-20 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799872, 245150, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool... it looks almost like an alien landscape. Beautiful colors. I wonder what this place looks like when the sun is low and the sky turns red.</td>', 'Cool... it looks almost like an alien landscape. Beautiful colors. I wonder what this place looks like when the sun is low and the sky turns red.', '2005-10-20 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799876, 244838, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very brave attempt of shooting into the sun. It''s very difficult to achieve good sharpness with all the glare, but your foreground is OK. The sky is a bit too blant tough.</td>', 'Very brave attempt of shooting into the sun. It''s very difficult to achieve good sharpness with all the glare, but your foreground is OK. The sky is a bit too blant tough.', '2005-10-20 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799877, 244453, 17203, '<td valign="top">20% funny, 80% ewwwwwwwwww!</td>', '20% funny, 80% ewwwwwwwwww!', '2005-10-20 23:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799881, 244426, 10275, '<td valign="top">I know these kind of moments are hard to capture. The harsh light and the contrast between light and dark areas make it even harder to achieve pleasing effect. I loke the girl''s expression of wonder and her hand stretched out in a gesture. But the image is overall a bit busy. The background is fairly sharp which makes it hard. Don''t be affraid of shallow depth of field to isolate the kids from the background.</td>', 'I know these kind of moments are hard to capture. The harsh light and the contrast between light and dark areas make it even harder to achieve pleasing effect. I loke the girl''s expression of wonder and her hand stretched out in a gesture. But the image is overall a bit busy. The background is fairly sharp which makes it hard. Don''t be affraid of shallow depth of field to isolate the kids from the background.', '2005-10-20 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799887, 244650, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice speed effect, but I don''t get the connection between the boat (is it a boat?) and it rushing into the woods. The colours are catching, but the sky is blown out missing the nice blue so much needed to balance the sharp yellows.</td>', 'Nice speed effect, but I don''t get the connection between the boat (is it a boat?) and it rushing into the woods. The colours are catching, but the sky is blown out missing the nice blue so much needed to balance the sharp yellows.', '2005-10-20 23:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799890, 245146, 10275, '<td valign="top">Were you after a perspective wide angle shot? Try shooting an architectural object - they are way more fun than grey computer shell. The cloning in the carpet is also quite obvious. Try softening the background and sharpening the computer case.</td>', 'Were you after a perspective wide angle shot? Try shooting an architectural object - they are way more fun than grey computer shell. The cloning in the carpet is also quite obvious. Try softening the background and sharpening the computer case.', '2005-10-20 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799893, 244364, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gold? They look quite dead. It''s a bit messy, not much to look at. Sorry.</td>', 'Gold? They look quite dead. It''s a bit messy, not much to look at. Sorry.', '2005-10-20 23:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799898, 244453, 10275, '<td valign="top">This could have worked if you shot if from a different angle making his head even bigger. Shallower depth of filed would have nicely separated him from the busy background.</td>', 'This could have worked if you shot if from a different angle making his head even bigger. Shallower depth of filed would have nicely separated him from the busy background.', '2005-10-20 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799901, 244047, 10275, '<td valign="top">Like the tilt, it makes the image interesting. Too bad he is not wearing some coloured t-shirt. The large black space makes the image a bit boring. It definitely needs some colour.</td>', 'Like the tilt, it makes the image interesting. Too bad he is not wearing some coloured t-shirt. The large black space makes the image a bit boring. It definitely needs some colour.', '2005-10-20 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799910, 243807, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very pretty... beautful color with a "fairytale" quality to it. A longer exposure would have been nice to balance all the fine detail against silky water. I probably would have cropped the bottom and cloned out the bush to make the view seem wider and offset the falls so they''re not vertically centered. Actually, knowing me, I probably would have waded out there and yanked the bush out by the roots. ;-p</td>', 'Very pretty... beautful color with a "fairytale" quality to it. A longer exposure would have been nice to balance all the fine detail against silky water. I probably would have cropped the bottom and cloned out the bush to make the view seem wider and offset the falls so they''re not vertically centered. Actually, knowing me, I probably would have waded out there and yanked the bush out by the roots. ;-p', '2005-10-20 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799914, 245170, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and composition. I can imagine this scene with fiery red and yallow maple trees along the horizon. *drool* 8</td>', 'Wonderful light and composition. I can imagine this scene with fiery red and yallow maple trees along the horizon. *drool* 8', '2005-10-20 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799920, 244972, 10275, '<td valign="top">Shooting into the Sun is always hard. I don''t know if the lens flare was intentional, but it distracts from the scene. The image is also a bit overexposed. If you use ND grad filter you can control the scene a bit better.</td>', 'Shooting into the Sun is always hard. I don''t know if the lens flare was intentional, but it distracts from the scene. The image is also a bit overexposed. If you use ND grad filter you can control the scene a bit better.', '2005-10-20 23:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799922, 245141, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, love the background mist. I like the desaturation, too, but it''s a little bit too much. Pity the sky wasn''t more cooperative.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, love the background mist. I like the desaturation, too, but it''s a little bit too much. Pity the sky wasn''t more cooperative.', '2005-10-20 23:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799928, 244907, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ahahahahahaha!  Great idea. Even better if you were closer to fill the frame and the background were, uh... <i>simplified.</i></td>', 'Ahahahahahaha!  Great idea. Even better if you were closer to fill the frame and the background were, uh... simplified.', '2005-10-20 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799935, 244970, 17203, '<td valign="top">OMG!! He whacked off her head!!!! Guess it wasn''t a safety Razor... ;-)<br/>Very good capture with great lighting. Well done! 8</td>', 'OMG!! He whacked off her head!!!! Guess it wasn''t a safety Razor... ;-)Very good capture with great lighting. Well done! 8', '2005-10-20 23:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799940, 245105, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fabulous scene. All the interest is in the lower half, so you could crop an inch off the top to make it seem more panoramic without losing any impact IMO. 8</td>', 'Fabulous scene. All the interest is in the lower half, so you could crop an inch off the top to make it seem more panoramic without losing any impact IMO. 8', '2005-10-20 23:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799946, 244991, 44107, '<td valign="top">Nice picture... but I don''t really feel wide-angle...</td>', 'Nice picture... but I don''t really feel wide-angle...', '2005-10-20 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799947, 243557, 17203, '<td valign="top">A promising scene, but it looks like you exposed for the sky. If you aimed for a good exposure on the land instead, it would have simultaneously lightened the foreground and made the clouds more ominous.</td>', 'A promising scene, but it looks like you exposed for the sky. If you aimed for a good exposure on the land instead, it would have simultaneously lightened the foreground and made the clouds more ominous.', '2005-10-20 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799949, 244551, 44107, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2005-10-20 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799954, 243979, 45926, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot. love the pun title. ^_^! the curves in this are very awesome. i don''t love the gray bottom left of the picture very much though. maybe a few adjustments in that area could''ve been done to make this picture even better. great job!</td>', 'very interesting shot. love the pun title. ^_^! the curves in this are very awesome. i don''t love the gray bottom left of the picture very much though. maybe a few adjustments in that area could''ve been done to make this picture even better. great job!', '2005-10-20 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799957, 244853, 45926, '<td valign="top">it''s lovely that u were able to take this picture, "from above" but i think that the quality of this pic, may have been the downside of taking this picture, while flying. but this pic is still very interesting. the train thing must''ve come just in time.  but nevertheless, good job. :)</td>', 'it''s lovely that u were able to take this picture, "from above" but i think that the quality of this pic, may have been the downside of taking this picture, while flying. but this pic is still very interesting. the train thing must''ve come just in time.  but nevertheless, good job. :)', '2005-10-20 23:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799961, 245132, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow! pretty! i love the clouds shape, and the coloring. for me, the whitish glare seems to be a smidge irritating. I thought that the birds reflection in the pool was just awesome though. great job.</td>', 'wow! pretty! i love the clouds shape, and the coloring. for me, the whitish glare seems to be a smidge irritating. I thought that the birds reflection in the pool was just awesome though. great job.', '2005-10-20 23:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
