(1800056, 245130, 35218, '<td valign="top">Pleasantville in colour?  Nice shot, well composed.  Not sure why but kept me looking at it for a while.</td>', 'Pleasantville in colour?  Nice shot, well composed.  Not sure why but kept me looking at it for a while.', '2005-10-21 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800063, 245016, 42638, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. Maybe I''ve played too much Zelda, couldn''t help but think of the "Wind Walker" with this picture and title. Nice job. Looks like she is really enjoying it. Beautiful break there too.</td>', 'Cute picture. Maybe I''ve played too much Zelda, couldn''t help but think of the "Wind Walker" with this picture and title. Nice job. Looks like she is really enjoying it. Beautiful break there too.', '2005-10-21 00:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800069, 244338, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, its almost like 2 pictures here. You could actually draw a horizontal line and they''d make complete pictures. Nice choice of subject here. I have to assume its a church of some type. Like the blown out highlights from outside. Nice touch.</td>', 'Wow, its almost like 2 pictures here. You could actually draw a horizontal line and they''d make complete pictures. Nice choice of subject here. I have to assume its a church of some type. Like the blown out highlights from outside. Nice touch.', '2005-10-21 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800071, 244446, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  Looks very over-sharpened on my monitor.</td>', 'Nice framing.  Looks very over-sharpened on my monitor.', '2005-10-21 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800074, 244946, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective here. Its a bit blown on the right but I love the stonework next to the blue sky at the top.</td>', 'Interesting perspective here. Its a bit blown on the right but I love the stonework next to the blue sky at the top.', '2005-10-21 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800076, 243795, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.</td>', 'Very nice effect.', '2005-10-21 00:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800078, 243195, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this is W-I-D-E! Nice shot. Love the cloud cover and the colors are amazing.</td>', 'Wow, now this is W-I-D-E! Nice shot. Love the cloud cover and the colors are amazing.', '2005-10-21 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800079, 245171, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nicely done.  Some more clouds would have made this shot.</td>', 'Nice idea and nicely done.  Some more clouds would have made this shot.', '2005-10-21 00:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800082, 244050, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture here. The sky is a bit blown but with this coloring, it works well.</td>', 'Beautiful texture here. The sky is a bit blown but with this coloring, it works well.', '2005-10-21 00:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800089, 244626, 35218, '<td valign="top">Conventional but well done.</td>', 'Conventional but well done.', '2005-10-21 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800095, 245149, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Comes across as a bit too other-worldly but nicely framed.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Comes across as a bit too other-worldly but nicely framed.', '2005-10-21 00:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800102, 244978, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  One of my favourites of the contest.  Nice to have something that''s not just anther landscape.</td>', 'Very nice.  One of my favourites of the contest.  Nice to have something that''s not just anther landscape.', '2005-10-21 00:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800110, 243979, 35218, '<td valign="top">It''s been done before but well executed.</td>', 'It''s been done before but well executed.', '2005-10-21 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800113, 244525, 35218, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is far too dark.  Very little that is visible.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is far too dark.  Very little that is visible.', '2005-10-21 00:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800116, 245100, 35218, '<td valign="top">Clever</td>', 'Clever', '2005-10-21 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800120, 244913, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice machine!  Very crisp shot with great detail.  Can''t help feeling that somwhere there''s a better perspective that could have made this shot a bit more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice machine!  Very crisp shot with great detail.  Can''t help feeling that somwhere there''s a better perspective that could have made this shot a bit more dynamic.', '2005-10-21 00:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800122, 242588, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice sunrise.  Photo looks very blurred on my monitor</td>', 'Nice sunrise.  Photo looks very blurred on my monitor', '2005-10-21 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800125, 245091, 35218, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2005-10-21 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800144, 244968, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-10-21 00:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800150, 245133, 35218, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition.  Pity that the light is a bit flat.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely composition.  Pity that the light is a bit flat.  Nice shot.', '2005-10-21 00:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800165, 243805, 35218, '<td valign="top">Effective.  Not too keen on the blue tone but that''s just personal preference.  Very nice shot</td>', 'Effective.  Not too keen on the blue tone but that''s just personal preference.  Very nice shot', '2005-10-21 00:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800174, 245094, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very nice and unusual.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Very nice and unusual.  One of my favourites.', '2005-10-21 00:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800184, 244452, 35218, '<td valign="top">Very effective</td>', 'Very effective', '2005-10-21 00:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800185, 245139, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Sky is a bit too darkened IMO.  Otherwise very effective.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Sky is a bit too darkened IMO.  Otherwise very effective.', '2005-10-21 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800202, 244286, 35218, '<td valign="top">Is this one of the most photographed locations in the US??  Nice picture though :)</td>', 'Is this one of the most photographed locations in the US??  Nice picture though :)', '2005-10-21 00:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800233, 244920, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tonality but the bottom 1/4 seems too soft, especially the trees.</td>', 'Beautiful tonality but the bottom 1/4 seems too soft, especially the trees.', '2005-10-21 01:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800237, 244309, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and good exposure but the clouds lack a rich tonality and the puddle in the background bothers me.</td>', 'Interesting composition and good exposure but the clouds lack a rich tonality and the puddle in the background bothers me.', '2005-10-21 01:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800242, 244995, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors seem too unnatural and oversaturated for my liking. I wish you hadn''t placed the horizon line dead center.</td>', 'Colors seem too unnatural and oversaturated for my liking. I wish you hadn''t placed the horizon line dead center.', '2005-10-21 01:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800251, 245050, 5822, '<td valign="top">Clouds and sky are equisite and I like the slivery sea, but I find the sand a bit too reddish/brown. The two people walking are a bit too obscure to add impact. Also, I also think you should change your style of title as it gives away the artist.</td>', 'Clouds and sky are equisite and I like the slivery sea, but I find the sand a bit too reddish/brown. The two people walking are a bit too obscure to add impact. Also, I also think you should change your style of title as it gives away the artist.', '2005-10-21 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800258, 244170, 5822, '<td valign="top">The image appears too flat, in both its spatial and color/tonal dimensions. The building looks as though it''s leaning backwards and compositionally I don''t think you gave the building enough space in the frame and I don''t like the head on angle.  Sorry for the harshness.</td>', 'The image appears too flat, in both its spatial and color/tonal dimensions. The building looks as though it''s leaning backwards and compositionally I don''t think you gave the building enough space in the frame and I don''t like the head on angle.  Sorry for the harshness.', '2005-10-21 01:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800261, 244909, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely moody composition. I wish there were a bit more richness to the color tones.  Not exactly sure what the title means.</td>', 'Lovely moody composition. I wish there were a bit more richness to the color tones.  Not exactly sure what the title means.', '2005-10-21 01:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800268, 242946, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great angle of view and reflection. Colors are a bit too warm and saturated for my tastes. Trees seem a bit too soft, especially in the upper right (too much NR?).  However, I really like the composition and the way the water leads the eye from lower left to upper right.  Good job.</td>', 'Great angle of view and reflection. Colors are a bit too warm and saturated for my tastes. Trees seem a bit too soft, especially in the upper right (too much NR?).  However, I really like the composition and the way the water leads the eye from lower left to upper right.  Good job.', '2005-10-21 01:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800275, 242887, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter and great WA capture, as you really get a good feel of height. I like the white on blue bg, but wish you had chosen to photograph it at another time of the day or at a different angle as I do not like the shadow facing the viewer.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter and great WA capture, as you really get a good feel of height. I like the white on blue bg, but wish you had chosen to photograph it at another time of the day or at a different angle as I do not like the shadow facing the viewer.', '2005-10-21 01:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800278, 245115, 46405, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2005-10-21 01:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800285, 244912, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way the boats are lit up against the dark night sky but think the exposure is a bit off as there is some blown highlights (lower left). Seems that the white balance is also off.</td>', 'I like the way the boats are lit up against the dark night sky but think the exposure is a bit off as there is some blown highlights (lower left). Seems that the white balance is also off.', '2005-10-21 01:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800302, 244978, 5822, '<td valign="top">Awesome WA capture of this place as you can really feel the largenss of its dimensions.  Tones are very nice and I like the dramatic lighting.  However, I find the people to be distracting because you seem to have captured them at a random moment.  The man has his back to us and is talking to another person.</td>', 'Awesome WA capture of this place as you can really feel the largenss of its dimensions.  Tones are very nice and I like the dramatic lighting.  However, I find the people to be distracting because you seem to have captured them at a random moment.  The man has his back to us and is talking to another person.', '2005-10-21 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800310, 244813, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the view a lot, but something seems off. Like maybe there should be a bit more contrast in the nearer mountains and not so much blue overall.  Looks too artificial.  Also, I don'' tlike the way the trees in the foreground have been cut off and the small patch of grass in the lower left is distracting.</td>', 'I like the view a lot, but something seems off. Like maybe there should be a bit more contrast in the nearer mountains and not so much blue overall.  Looks too artificial.  Also, I don'' tlike the way the trees in the foreground have been cut off and the small patch of grass in the lower left is distracting.', '2005-10-21 02:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800314, 245009, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vivid colors however, focus seems a bit too soft overall and I wish the road lead to something.</td>', 'Wonderful vivid colors however, focus seems a bit too soft overall and I wish the road lead to something.', '2005-10-21 02:15:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1800321, 244626, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent night capture, great exposure. I don''t see a spec of noise. Must be a 20D.  I don''t like the pillar you caught in the lower left and the building  in the background at right edge.  Are those the blur of a passing cars lights?</td>', 'Excellent night capture, great exposure. I don''t see a spec of noise. Must be a 20D.  I don''t like the pillar you caught in the lower left and the building  in the background at right edge.  Are those the blur of a passing cars lights?', '2005-10-21 02:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800328, 243473, 5822, '<td valign="top">SUPER composition ! ! !  Love the lighting, especially on the building in the lower right which kind of has a surreal effect. I even like the curves of the electrical lines.  Wish you had been able to get a bit lower to capture more of the street level but that would have probably meant shooing from inside a sewer hole.  Image quality is a bit compromised by the noise in the sky (probably created in PP software?).  Great job!</td>', 'SUPER composition ! ! !  Love the lighting, especially on the building in the lower right which kind of has a surreal effect. I even like the curves of the electrical lines.  Wish you had been able to get a bit lower to capture more of the street level but that would have probably meant shooing from inside a sewer hole.  Image quality is a bit compromised by the noise in the sky (probably created in PP software?).  Great job!', '2005-10-21 02:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800329, 244614, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice natural colors and tones, but the buildings look as though they are about to fall over.</td>', 'Nice natural colors and tones, but the buildings look as though they are about to fall over.', '2005-10-21 02:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800333, 244691, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the texture of the columns but think the shot is underexposed and white balance is off.  Too much yellow.</td>', 'I like the capture of the texture of the columns but think the shot is underexposed and white balance is off.  Too much yellow.', '2005-10-21 02:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800338, 244798, 5822, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad overexposed, especially the blown out detail-less sky.</td>', 'Seems a tad overexposed, especially the blown out detail-less sky.', '2005-10-21 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800341, 243807, 5822, '<td valign="top">Could be a very beautiful composition with great color, but it''s way too soft.  I think you used too slow of a shutter speed while handholding.</td>', 'Could be a very beautiful composition with great color, but it''s way too soft.  I think you used too slow of a shutter speed while handholding.', '2005-10-21 02:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800346, 244976, 5822, '<td valign="top">Talk about crystal clarity! Great reflection.  Not crazy about the composition, though. 7 for technical excellence.</td>', 'Talk about crystal clarity! Great reflection.  Not crazy about the composition, though. 7 for technical excellence.', '2005-10-21 02:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800348, 245132, 5822, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS LOVE THIS LOVE THIS !<br/>Looks like a infrared capture with some really good pp. The clouds really stand out and I like the two toned sky. Gives a surreal effect.  The birds at the bottom give this picture a classic vintage feel. Wonderful job. 10<br/>Btw...I live on Long Island too. North shore.</td>', 'LOVE THIS LOVE THIS LOVE THIS !Looks like a infrared capture with some really good pp. The clouds really stand out and I like the two toned sky. Gives a surreal effect.  The birds at the bottom give this picture a classic vintage feel. Wonderful job. 10Btw...I live on Long Island too. North shore.', '2005-10-21 02:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800358, 242588, 5822, '<td valign="top">Could be a very nice sunrise photo as I really like the composition and lighting <br/>but it appears too blurry (handheld camera at low shutter speed?) and foreground is too dark.</td>', 'Could be a very nice sunrise photo as I really like the composition and lighting but it appears too blurry (handheld camera at low shutter speed?) and foreground is too dark.', '2005-10-21 03:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800363, 243799, 19831, '<td valign="top">Totally gorgeous shot! Majestic point of view, excellant detail. I like the reflection too. Very well done.</td>', 'Totally gorgeous shot! Majestic point of view, excellant detail. I like the reflection too. Very well done.', '2005-10-21 03:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800368, 244452, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective shot. Good framing. I like the black and white, works well against the blue sky. Nice lines too.</td>', 'Cool perspective shot. Good framing. I like the black and white, works well against the blue sky. Nice lines too.', '2005-10-21 03:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800370, 245006, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice sedate landscape, albeit a little on the dark side, but I like that.</td>', 'Nice sedate landscape, albeit a little on the dark side, but I like that.', '2005-10-21 03:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800372, 244050, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. I really like your processing here, I think it suits the image well. It has a very ''post apacolyptic'' feel to it. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool image. I really like your processing here, I think it suits the image well. It has a very ''post apacolyptic'' feel to it. Nice job.', '2005-10-21 03:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800377, 243195, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones in that sky! I like the mimimalist approach to your horizon here. The small sliver of land I think is a nice anchor to the weight of the magnificant sky. I see many shots where the goal is obviously to let the sky and it''s colors serve as the subject, often times it falls short of being highly interesting. I think in this case you''ve made it work. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful tones in that sky! I like the mimimalist approach to your horizon here. The small sliver of land I think is a nice anchor to the weight of the magnificant sky. I see many shots where the goal is obviously to let the sky and it''s colors serve as the subject, often times it falls short of being highly interesting. I think in this case you''ve made it work. Nice job.', '2005-10-21 03:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800378, 245148, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Seems like focus could be sharper.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Seems like focus could be sharper.', '2005-10-21 03:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800381, 244425, 19831, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Great composition, nice leading lines. Awesome point of view. Nice choice of speed, the blur on the runner is nice, serves a definite purpose, adds a lot to an already cool shot. Great b/w conversion too, image has a great feel. Very nice, very, very nice. Thanks :-)</td>', 'I really like this shot. Great composition, nice leading lines. Awesome point of view. Nice choice of speed, the blur on the runner is nice, serves a definite purpose, adds a lot to an already cool shot. Great b/w conversion too, image has a great feel. Very nice, very, very nice. Thanks :-)', '2005-10-21 03:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800382, 244279, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Great composition, real nice tones. Suit guy adds a lot to the shot too. Good job.</td>', 'Very cool. Great composition, real nice tones. Suit guy adds a lot to the shot too. Good job.', '2005-10-21 03:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800385, 245037, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject. I like the orange/green thing going on. Good use of lines in the composition. IMO, a couple things might improve the presentation here, one, perhaps a lower, more dramatic point of view could add some interest. Also, I''m thinking maybe some levels and/or saturation adj. could be beneficial, boost sat just a tad, and tweak levels a little, make it a little brighter and add some depth to the darks, increasing the tonal range.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject. I like the orange/green thing going on. Good use of lines in the composition. IMO, a couple things might improve the presentation here, one, perhaps a lower, more dramatic point of view could add some interest. Also, I''m thinking maybe some levels and/or saturation adj. could be beneficial, boost sat just a tad, and tweak levels a little, make it a little brighter and add some depth to the darks, increasing the tonal range.', '2005-10-21 03:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800386, 244880, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dramatic shot.  The building is just on the threshold of being blown out but not quite.  Love the lighting. Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful dramatic shot.  The building is just on the threshold of being blown out but not quite.  Love the lighting. Excellent work.', '2005-10-21 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800392, 245172, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the exposure. The water looks good.</td>', 'Nice job on the exposure. The water looks good.', '2005-10-21 03:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800394, 244917, 17507, '<td valign="top">jesus</td>', 'jesus', '2005-10-21 03:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800397, 245150, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Beautiful image. Beautiful job.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Beautiful image. Beautiful job.', '2005-10-21 03:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800400, 244974, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. Makes me woozy :-)</td>', 'Cool effect. Makes me woozy :-)', '2005-10-21 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800548, 245015, 46417, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and angle</td>', 'Nice colors and angle', '2005-10-21 07:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800586, 244968, 25355, '<td valign="top">Shame about the shadow on the bottom right - a signpost?</td>', 'Shame about the shadow on the bottom right - a signpost?', '2005-10-21 09:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800829, 245095, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful image. I think that I would c;lone out the house though.</td>', 'This is a very powerful image. I think that I would c;lone out the house though.', '2005-10-21 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800860, 245105, 11467, '<td valign="top">Wow, Taupo! I''ve spent a large chunk of my life there!<br/>Nice image but missing some pop.<br/>Composition is great, just the lighting isn''t helping you.<br/></td>', 'Wow, Taupo! I''ve spent a large chunk of my life there!Nice image but missing some pop.Composition is great, just the lighting isn''t helping you.', '2005-10-21 11:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800911, 244465, 3569, '<td valign="top">great dof.  Nice shot</td>', 'great dof.  Nice shot', '2005-10-21 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800912, 245027, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful contrasts</td>', 'wonderful contrasts', '2005-10-21 11:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800915, 245172, 3569, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, in my top three in this challenge</td>', 'beautiful shot, in my top three in this challenge', '2005-10-21 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800919, 244888, 3569, '<td valign="top">excellent dof and coloration</td>', 'excellent dof and coloration', '2005-10-21 11:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800921, 244542, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot in all ways</td>', 'wonderful shot in all ways', '2005-10-21 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800923, 244909, 3569, '<td valign="top">excellent shot in all ways</td>', 'excellent shot in all ways', '2005-10-21 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800961, 242741, 30896, '<td valign="top">lovely color, both gold and sky, however the composition seems to be too limited by the architecture</td>', 'lovely color, both gold and sky, however the composition seems to be too limited by the architecture', '2005-10-21 12:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800997, 244665, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit underexposed</td>', 'Looks a bit underexposed', '2005-10-21 12:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801014, 244286, 5822, '<td valign="top">Color is a bit flat, but I like the WA effect.</td>', 'Color is a bit flat, but I like the WA effect.', '2005-10-21 12:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801021, 244537, 5822, '<td valign="top">Like the image very much, especially its tonality, texture of the fence and it''s use for framing, as well as, inclusion of the environs.  I do, however, think it would have been better to not cut off the horse''s nose and I wish the background sky was more interesting.</td>', 'Like the image very much, especially its tonality, texture of the fence and it''s use for framing, as well as, inclusion of the environs.  I do, however, think it would have been better to not cut off the horse''s nose and I wish the background sky was more interesting.', '2005-10-21 12:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801031, 244667, 5822, '<td valign="top">Dark shadow on the side of the building is distracting and the image appears a bit underexposed.  Nice color of the sky, but I find the subject matter and the large amount of grass included in the foreground to be uninspirational.</td>', 'Dark shadow on the side of the building is distracting and the image appears a bit underexposed.  Nice color of the sky, but I find the subject matter and the large amount of grass included in the foreground to be uninspirational.', '2005-10-21 12:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801180, 245039, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great capture and angle of view! It really shows off your subject well, including the zebra''s pose. I''ll bet that you will have some people stating the background is distracting and that you should have used a more narrow DOF to isolate your subject. I probably would have agreed with that assessment if the composition was not as good as it is...very well balanced and simple.  Outstanding work. 10</td>', 'Great capture and angle of view! It really shows off your subject well, including the zebra''s pose. I''ll bet that you will have some people stating the background is distracting and that you should have used a more narrow DOF to isolate your subject. I probably would have agreed with that assessment if the composition was not as good as it is...very well balanced and simple.  Outstanding work. 10', '2005-10-21 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801200, 244754, 5822, '<td valign="top">A nice image that could use, imo, a bit more exposure, especially on the choir.</td>', 'A nice image that could use, imo, a bit more exposure, especially on the choir.', '2005-10-21 14:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801330, 244824, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the elegant indoors setting matched against the outdoor scene very much.  However, I think the lighting could have been improved greatly.  For one, I think you should have photographed at a different time of the day when the sun wasn''t directly behind one of the walls and creating a glare on the water and dark shadows on the table.  Maybe photographing at sunset when the sky had more color would have made it more interesting. Also,  the walls and table are quite dark from those shadows created by the sun and I think either using fill flash or a slow synch flash setting where you meter on the outdoors would have shown more of the detail on the table and walls and made for a more attractive picture.  Also, I think shooting at a different angle of view so that the outdoor scene showed more of the trees and grass of the marsh, like the window on the left, would have improved the shot.  Finally, I think you should have removed the chairs against the windows (not the ones at the table), as they create clutter.</td>', 'I like the elegant indoors setting matched against the outdoor scene very much.  However, I think the lighting could have been improved greatly.  For one, I think you should have photographed at a different time of the day when the sun wasn''t directly behind one of the walls and creating a glare on the water and dark shadows on the table.  Maybe photographing at sunset when the sky had more color would have made it more interesting. Also,  the walls and table are quite dark from those shadows created by the sun and I think either using fill flash or a slow synch flash setting where you meter on the outdoors would have shown more of the detail on the table and walls and made for a more attractive picture.  Also, I think shooting at a different angle of view so that the outdoor scene showed more of the trees and grass of the marsh, like the window on the left, would have improved the shot.  Finally, I think you should have removed the chairs against the windows (not the ones at the table), as they create clutter.', '2005-10-21 15:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
