(1802399, 244446, 41522, '<td valign="top">The wide angle is evident.  The foreground use adds soe depth for the wide angle to hold on to. A couple of things about the photo trouble me.  It feels like there is too much noise in the image, especially in the blues of the sky and the reflection.  Also, the grasses look a little oversharpened.  If I''m wrong on my assessment of the USM, please forgive me, it just feels like the foreground colours and whites give the sense of too much sharpening.  JMO.</td>', 'The wide angle is evident.  The foreground use adds soe depth for the wide angle to hold on to. A couple of things about the photo trouble me.  It feels like there is too much noise in the image, especially in the blues of the sky and the reflection.  Also, the grasses look a little oversharpened.  If I''m wrong on my assessment of the USM, please forgive me, it just feels like the foreground colours and whites give the sense of too much sharpening.  JMO.', '2005-10-21 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
