(1804839, 244612, 41675, '<td valign="top">You captured some really amazing colors! For me, I would have cropped in further from the left, just past that one post. I don''t mind the others that are grouped together in the middle, but for some reason I think I would like this better without the one on the left. Again, excellent sky.</td>', 'You captured some really amazing colors! For me, I would have cropped in further from the left, just past that one post. I don''t mind the others that are grouped together in the middle, but for some reason I think I would like this better without the one on the left. Again, excellent sky.', '2005-10-23 12:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804840, 244562, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle on the sky. For me, I would like to see more of the foreground landscape. Not much, but another 1/4 inch or so.</td>', 'Nice wide angle on the sky. For me, I would like to see more of the foreground landscape. Not much, but another 1/4 inch or so.', '2005-10-23 12:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804851, 245115, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle shot. I like the water. If there had been just a bit more light on the rockfaces I would have scored it even higher - bumping it up after a second look.</td>', 'Nice wide angle shot. I like the water. If there had been just a bit more light on the rockfaces I would have scored it even higher - bumping it up after a second look.', '2005-10-23 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804852, 244798, 41675, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strieks me about your photo is that it seems tipped. For me, I wonder how this would look if you rotated a degree counterclockwise?</td>', 'The first thing that strieks me about your photo is that it seems tipped. For me, I wonder how this would look if you rotated a degree counterclockwise?', '2005-10-23 12:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804858, 245020, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool structure. I like light reflections. For me, I would have cropped out that element in the upper right as I find it a bit distracting. The tree adds interest for me and without it, I think it would have been nice, but boring. Good eye.</td>', 'Very cool structure. I like light reflections. For me, I would have cropped out that element in the upper right as I find it a bit distracting. The tree adds interest for me and without it, I think it would have been nice, but boring. Good eye.', '2005-10-23 12:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804862, 244050, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the lower two thirds of your photo. For me, the highlights in the sky are a bit too bright, but a good wide angle shot.</td>', 'I like the lower two thirds of your photo. For me, the highlights in the sky are a bit too bright, but a good wide angle shot.', '2005-10-23 12:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804867, 243869, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at your photo for a few minutes now. At times I get a 3-D sense. The sky seems so unnaturally orange, but with the silhouetted tree and the black border I think that''s how I get that feeling. The hill line behind the tree seems a bit odd, perhaps from post-editing. Hmmm...I find this intriguing.</td>', 'I''ve looked at your photo for a few minutes now. At times I get a 3-D sense. The sky seems so unnaturally orange, but with the silhouetted tree and the black border I think that''s how I get that feeling. The hill line behind the tree seems a bit odd, perhaps from post-editing. Hmmm...I find this intriguing.', '2005-10-23 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804872, 245094, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle shot. I wonder how this would look if you had shown even more of the sky? The large white line of the field in the foreground is a bit distracting for me, but again, nice wide angle entry.</td>', 'Nice wide angle shot. I wonder how this would look if you had shown even more of the sky? The large white line of the field in the foreground is a bit distracting for me, but again, nice wide angle entry.', '2005-10-23 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804875, 245148, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how you chose to enter a vertical shot instead of horizontal. For me, I wish the line of boats had either been higher of lower and not so close to being in the dead center of the photo. My favorite part is actually the rocks on the beach in the foreground. I like the warm colors.</td>', 'I like how you chose to enter a vertical shot instead of horizontal. For me, I wish the line of boats had either been higher of lower and not so close to being in the dead center of the photo. My favorite part is actually the rocks on the beach in the foreground. I like the warm colors.', '2005-10-23 13:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804881, 244497, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo my eyes follow the yellow lines directly to the main building and stop there. I really don''t look at either side because of that. It could just be me, but the sky seems so bright and vibrant compared to the buildings. I wonder if you did some extra post processing on the sky alone?</td>', 'When I look at your photo my eyes follow the yellow lines directly to the main building and stop there. I really don''t look at either side because of that. It could just be me, but the sky seems so bright and vibrant compared to the buildings. I wonder if you did some extra post processing on the sky alone?', '2005-10-23 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804884, 244170, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting building. My favorite part are the shadows created in the glass area of the building in the middle. I wonder how this would look if rotated slightly counterclockwise as it looks to be slightly tipped to the right.</td>', 'Interesting building. My favorite part are the shadows created in the glass area of the building in the middle. I wonder how this would look if rotated slightly counterclockwise as it looks to be slightly tipped to the right.', '2005-10-23 13:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804889, 244514, 41675, '<td valign="top">Compared with other entries, I don''t get a true wide angle sense (even though you may have used a wide angle lens) Perhaps it''s from the large black area on the right hand side - I''m not sure. My favorite part is the lighted area itself on the house, nice dark sky too.</td>', 'Compared with other entries, I don''t get a true wide angle sense (even though you may have used a wide angle lens) Perhaps it''s from the large black area on the right hand side - I''m not sure. My favorite part is the lighted area itself on the house, nice dark sky too.', '2005-10-23 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804892, 243422, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors. For me, it gives your photo a spooky, surreal kind of feeling.</td>', 'Interesting colors. For me, it gives your photo a spooky, surreal kind of feeling.', '2005-10-23 13:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804895, 244724, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this shot. Had it not been for the rainbow colored flare I would have scored it higher. I find that colorful flare "fights" and distracts from the rest of your photo and it''s muted tones.</td>', 'Overall, I like this shot. Had it not been for the rainbow colored flare I would have scored it higher. I find that colorful flare "fights" and distracts from the rest of your photo and it''s muted tones.', '2005-10-23 13:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804898, 244824, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I think this would would better froma slightly different angle. Something that wouldn''t place the candles and chandelier in the dead center. I like the lighting on the table and the shadows.</td>', 'For me, I think this would would better froma slightly different angle. Something that wouldn''t place the candles and chandelier in the dead center. I like the lighting on the table and the shadows.', '2005-10-23 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804900, 244869, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice photo which I think could be improved by changing your horizon a bit. I would have liked to seen more of the sky and a bit less of the water. For me, the sky looks more interesting.</td>', 'Nice photo which I think could be improved by changing your horizon a bit. I would have liked to seen more of the sky and a bit less of the water. For me, the sky looks more interesting.', '2005-10-23 13:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804902, 244981, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle and composition. For me, I think a bit more contrast would help the flat gray tones in the foreground. I also wonder what this would look like in color.</td>', 'Nice wide angle and composition. For me, I think a bit more contrast would help the flat gray tones in the foreground. I also wonder what this would look like in color.', '2005-10-23 13:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804903, 243795, 43690, '<td valign="top">Perfect sense of motion.</td>', 'Perfect sense of motion.', '2005-10-23 13:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804905, 244919, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the post-processing you did on the foreground (and I''m not usually a big fan of that). I wonder if in doing so though, you have lost some of the needed detail in the tree lines? For me, I would have scored it higher had there been more definition because the sky is such a pale blue and lots of sunlight.</td>', 'I like the post-processing you did on the foreground (and I''m not usually a big fan of that). I wonder if in doing so though, you have lost some of the needed detail in the tree lines? For me, I would have scored it higher had there been more definition because the sky is such a pale blue and lots of sunlight.', '2005-10-23 13:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804907, 244095, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting wide angle. I like how the arm of the dish directs my eye to the line of the house, but compared with other entries doesn''t hold my interest as much.</td>', 'Interesting wide angle. I like how the arm of the dish directs my eye to the line of the house, but compared with other entries doesn''t hold my interest as much.', '2005-10-23 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804909, 244058, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle of a game. Hope they won. It that Marshall University? (I used to live in Charleston, WV</td>', 'Nice wide angle of a game. Hope they won. It that Marshall University? (I used to live in Charleston, WV', '2005-10-23 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804911, 243560, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a vertical wide angle shot. Bumping up after second look. The lamp posts detract a bit, but cool shot.</td>', 'Nice to see a vertical wide angle shot. Bumping up after second look. The lamp posts detract a bit, but cool shot.', '2005-10-23 13:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804915, 244913, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Your title and photo make me smile. Very nice and well kept van. I like the overcast sky, but that bit of blue sky refelction on the van seems out of place (even though that appears to be a break in the storm).</td>', ':-) Your title and photo make me smile. Very nice and well kept van. I like the overcast sky, but that bit of blue sky refelction on the van seems out of place (even though that appears to be a break in the storm).', '2005-10-23 13:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804918, 243557, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your off centered composition. Keeping the road to a minimum so it doesn''t detract form the sky was a good thing in my opinion. The landscape is a bit dark. I wish there had been a touch more light as it looks quite nice. My favorite part of your shot is the sky itself.</td>', 'I like your off centered composition. Keeping the road to a minimum so it doesn''t detract form the sky was a good thing in my opinion. The landscape is a bit dark. I wish there had been a touch more light as it looks quite nice. My favorite part of your shot is the sky itself.', '2005-10-23 13:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804920, 244723, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and angle you chose. It gives me the illusion that the left foot of the girl in the swing is about to step on (or kick) the small child. I wonder how this would look if you cropped up from the bottom to eliminate that illusion thereby eliminating the bike in the lower right hand side too? I think black and white works well for this shot.</td>', 'I like the subject and angle you chose. It gives me the illusion that the left foot of the girl in the swing is about to step on (or kick) the small child. I wonder how this would look if you cropped up from the bottom to eliminate that illusion thereby eliminating the bike in the lower right hand side too? I think black and white works well for this shot.', '2005-10-23 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804921, 245037, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice line of pumpkins. My eyes follow the green areas in between and that leads them right up to the top and out of the frame. I would have liked to seen that bit of brown line at the very top cropped out, but nice, vibrant colors. Looks like a fun place to take kids to pick out a pumpkin.</td>', 'Nice line of pumpkins. My eyes follow the green areas in between and that leads them right up to the top and out of the frame. I would have liked to seen that bit of brown line at the very top cropped out, but nice, vibrant colors. Looks like a fun place to take kids to pick out a pumpkin.', '2005-10-23 13:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804922, 243805, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo, I keep wishing there was another bike behind him or in front of him. I think that would help your title. The rider seems to be all alone. If there were another rider it would add more interest for me.</td>', 'When I look at your photo, I keep wishing there was another bike behind him or in front of him. I think that would help your title. The rider seems to be all alone. If there were another rider it would add more interest for me.', '2005-10-23 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804926, 244042, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the setup and angle. For me though, I wish there was a bit more focus overall. I also wonder who this would look in color.</td>', 'I like the setup and angle. For me though, I wish there was a bit more focus overall. I also wonder who this would look in color.', '2005-10-23 13:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
