(1805130, 244426, 43115, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of her face!  She looks liks she''s really deep on thought, which conflicts with the "fun" feeling of the scene. Nice and sharp and colorful though.</td>', 'I wish I could see more of her face!  She looks liks she''s really deep on thought, which conflicts with the "fun" feeling of the scene. Nice and sharp and colorful though.', '2005-10-23 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
