(1805157, 244316, 43115, '<td valign="top">Visible tilt, the shot needs to be rotated slightly counter-clockwise.  Otherwise it could be an interesting scene, but it needs a little more depth of field so that more of the train is sharp.</td>', 'Visible tilt, the shot needs to be rotated slightly counter-clockwise.  Otherwise it could be an interesting scene, but it needs a little more depth of field so that more of the train is sharp.', '2005-10-23 16:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
