(1806458, 243979, 45965, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yellowpeep:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a great subject for this challenge.  I wish the center had not been centered so much. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, but it is the only position under the stairs where you get the illusion of an eye.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yellowpeep: This is a great subject for this challenge.  I wish the center had not been centered so much.  Yes, but it is the only position under the stairs where you get the illusion of an eye.', '2005-10-24 02:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
