(1806463, 243979, 45965, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by madison461:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice perspective shot.   My eye is drawn to the blue/white center at the top then the hot spot on the first level.  I feel this composition could have been different and improved by a different angle from the bottom. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, there are several possibilities and I will upload a few others for comparison. You get very different looks depending on where you position the camera.</td>', 'Originally posted by madison461: Nice perspective shot.   My eye is drawn to the blue/white center at the top then the hot spot on the first level.  I feel this composition could have been different and improved by a different angle from the bottom.  Yes, there are several possibilities and I will upload a few others for comparison. You get very different looks depending on where you position the camera.', '2005-10-24 02:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
