(1806473, 243979, 45965, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by stare_at_the_sun:</b></div><hr/><i> I think I would like this more if the picture was taken directly underneath the staicase. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''ll upload one or two others with different perspectives.</td>', 'Originally posted by stare_at_the_sun: I think I would like this more if the picture was taken directly underneath the staicase.  I''ll upload one or two others with different perspectives.', '2005-10-24 02:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
