(1806480, 243979, 45965, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fstopopen:</b></div><hr/><i> yeah boy, that is wide angle. why the dead space at the top? </i></td></tr></table>If you mean the blown out white circle, there''s a ceiling window at the top over the stairwell and the difference in exposure was just too much.</td>', 'Originally posted by fstopopen: yeah boy, that is wide angle. why the dead space at the top? If you mean the blown out white circle, there''s a ceiling window at the top over the stairwell and the difference in exposure was just too much.', '2005-10-24 02:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
