(1808476, 243808, 37719, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo and thought it was well composed.  The colors are well balanced and the processing is not screaming at you.  Nice photo, nice job!  Well done in my opinion.  Makes me want to go out and try and shoot the covered bridges around here.</td>', 'I liked this photo and thought it was well composed.  The colors are well balanced and the processing is not screaming at you.  Nice photo, nice job!  Well done in my opinion.  Makes me want to go out and try and shoot the covered bridges around here.', '2005-10-24 20:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
