(1808849, 243799, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Harvey!  You got a ribbon!!!!  Beautiful picture.</td>', 'Congratulations, Harvey!  You got a ribbon!!!!  Beautiful picture.', '2005-10-24 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808856, 243153, 43400, '<td valign="top">This is such a great image and it''s one I can''t take my eyes off. Well deserved 1st place and many congrats.</td>', 'This is such a great image and it''s one I can''t take my eyes off. Well deserved 1st place and many congrats.', '2005-10-24 22:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808888, 244916, 30364, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Nuno.  I am delighted to see your name on the ribbon page ... I have admired your stuff ever since your Long Exposure image, which was cruelly under-estimated by the voters.  This one is very beautiful and also a little more DPC-friendly!  I did not vote, or even look at the entries until now, but this image would have been in my top two choices.  Bravo!</td>', 'Congratulations, Nuno.  I am delighted to see your name on the ribbon page ... I have admired your stuff ever since your Long Exposure image, which was cruelly under-estimated by the voters.  This one is very beautiful and also a little more DPC-friendly!  I did not vote, or even look at the entries until now, but this image would have been in my top two choices.  Bravo!', '2005-10-24 23:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808902, 245015, 19066, '<td valign="top">Brilliant perspective on such a cliched location.  Really, the fisheye just works here!  This should be in New York Magazine or some other publication somewhere...</td>', 'Brilliant perspective on such a cliched location.  Really, the fisheye just works here!  This should be in New York Magazine or some other publication somewhere...', '2005-10-24 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808922, 244978, 30364, '<td valign="top">Did not vote, nor even look at the entries.  This is sublime, subtle and stylish and so wins my S-S-Special Hindsight Blue Ribbon (a very rare &amp; quite worthless award).  Surely the man in the overcoat is Richard Harris?</td>', 'Did not vote, nor even look at the entries.  This is sublime, subtle and stylish and so wins my S-S-Special Hindsight Blue Ribbon (a very rare & quite worthless award).  Surely the man in the overcoat is Richard Harris?', '2005-10-24 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808939, 245095, 27373, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly powerful photo.  I so wish I would''ve had time to vote on this challenge.  Simply amazing.</td>', 'This is an incredibly powerful photo.  I so wish I would''ve had time to vote on this challenge.  Simply amazing.', '2005-10-24 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808946, 245126, 46402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view - I wish I could have seen it myself! Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful view - I wish I could have seen it myself! Great job.', '2005-10-24 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808953, 243795, 46448, '<td valign="top">This is one of My favorites, I''m still wondering how you got this picture, at the end of the runway. It''s one of my favorites!</td>', 'This is one of My favorites, I''m still wondering how you got this picture, at the end of the runway. It''s one of my favorites!', '2005-10-24 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808965, 244978, 20462, '<td valign="top">bye bye richard harris.  no couldn''t be, it isn''t a bar.  <br/> <br/>E301, I find you to be my favorite photographer, and appreciate your entry here.  I wish you would enter more often....</td>', 'bye bye richard harris.  no couldn''t be, it isn''t a bar.   E301, I find you to be my favorite photographer, and appreciate your entry here.  I wish you would enter more often....', '2005-10-24 23:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1808986, 243799, 23456, '<td valign="top">Well Done ! Love the composition and tones in this image !<br/>-Lisa</td>', 'Well Done ! Love the composition and tones in this image !-Lisa', '2005-10-25 00:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809050, 245015, 40819, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry folks, nothing you couldn''t do with a $3000 lens. LOL Just kidding Steve, wow I know a guy who got 4th place. Excellent work. I knew it was you when I saw it for the first time but that isn''t why I gave it a 9, it is worth a 9 at least and you ended up 4th and I am so happy for you.<br/> <br/>I happen to love NYC and any new and innovative way to photograph it is welcome in my eyes. Your editing in Photoshop is excellent as well, not just B&amp;W or Sepia a little of everything and it paid off looks great congratulations.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=246965" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/246965.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/246965.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40819/thumb/246965.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-24 23:18:29.</i></td>', 'Don''t worry folks, nothing you couldn''t do with a $3000 lens. LOL Just kidding Steve, wow I know a guy who got 4th place. Excellent work. I knew it was you when I saw it for the first time but that isn''t why I gave it a 9, it is worth a 9 at least and you ended up 4th and I am so happy for you. I happen to love NYC and any new and innovative way to photograph it is welcome in my eyes. Your editing in Photoshop is excellent as well, not just B&W or Sepia a little of everything and it paid off looks great congratulations. Mike ', '2005-10-25 00:16:02.000000', '2005-10-25 00:18:29.000000', 0),
(1809214, 243153, 45579, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.  Beautiful sky.</td>', 'I like it a lot.  Beautiful sky.', '2005-10-25 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809417, 244916, 20774, '<td valign="top">Parabens nuno uma foto muito bem conseguida dessa nossa bela ponte...<br/>Great shot Nuno. Wonderful bridge this is. a very well won ribbon.Very well composed...<br/>Happy to see us portuguese winning some ribbons hehe.<br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Parabens nuno uma foto muito bem conseguida dessa nossa bela ponte...Great shot Nuno. Wonderful bridge this is. a very well won ribbon.Very well composed...Happy to see us portuguese winning some ribbons hehe.Keep up the good work.', '2005-10-25 02:22:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809541, 244838, 34547, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the more underrated photos I''ve seen. I like the bright sun. It helps put me in the scene. This is a decent photo. I''ve scored high and very low but I''ve always got my own opinions on what it should have scored. Keep shooting. Good luck!</td>', 'This has to be one of the more underrated photos I''ve seen. I like the bright sun. It helps put me in the scene. This is a decent photo. I''ve scored high and very low but I''ve always got my own opinions on what it should have scored. Keep shooting. Good luck!', '2005-10-25 04:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809557, 245095, 45922, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. I think that you aligned the subject perfectly. And I just love the leading lines leading to the subject. I can definently tell where the focus is in this photograph. This is a perfect wide angle picture, and the black and white just adds to the image. Oh, and the message is so powerful, it makes me weep inside.  BEAUTIFUL JOB!</td>', 'I love this picture. I think that you aligned the subject perfectly. And I just love the leading lines leading to the subject. I can definently tell where the focus is in this photograph. This is a perfect wide angle picture, and the black and white just adds to the image. Oh, and the message is so powerful, it makes me weep inside.  BEAUTIFUL JOB!', '2005-10-25 04:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809559, 245015, 39427, '<td valign="top">Awesome comp and post-processing.  I love seeing great NY photos b/c when you''re familiar w/ a location, seeing how someone else shoots it provides a different and perhaps deeper experience of a photo than when you haven''t witnessed the place with your own eyes.<br/> <br/>Should have ribbon''d IMO (no offense to the deserving winners)<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Awesome comp and post-processing.  I love seeing great NY photos b/c when you''re familiar w/ a location, seeing how someone else shoots it provides a different and perhaps deeper experience of a photo than when you haven''t witnessed the place with your own eyes. Should have ribbon''d IMO (no offense to the deserving winners) Great job.', '2005-10-25 04:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809571, 244916, 19333, '<td valign="top">Os meus parabens, Nuno. <br/>I''m delighted to see you won a ribbon, which happens to be the logical thing with this wonderful pic. <br/>The bridge leads you to infinty (and beyond!! ;) and the people in the front adds some sense of scale.<br/>A must see when visiting Lisbon for sure!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Os meus parabens, Nuno. I''m delighted to see you won a ribbon, which happens to be the logical thing with this wonderful pic. The bridge leads you to infinty (and beyond!! ;) and the people in the front adds some sense of scale.A must see when visiting Lisbon for sure! ', '2005-10-25 05:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809579, 245015, 33652, '<td valign="top">Wow. This makes me change my feelings about the fisheye lens! I want one! Exceptional and memorable photograph. Well done.</td>', 'Wow. This makes me change my feelings about the fisheye lens! I want one! Exceptional and memorable photograph. Well done.', '2005-10-25 05:32:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809643, 243153, 35876, '<td valign="top">Simple,natural and great!</td>', 'Simple,natural and great!', '2005-10-25 07:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809721, 243153, 42840, '<td valign="top">amazing shot. superb</td>', 'amazing shot. superb', '2005-10-25 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1809759, 244338, 35720, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot everyone for your votes and coments - much appreciated!</td>', 'Thanks a lot everyone for your votes and coments - much appreciated!', '2005-10-25 09:14:02.000000', NULL, 0),
