(1811757, 243979, 45965, '<td valign="top">Thanks eveyone for voting and commenting! I''m very happy with the 10th place for my first entry, the winners are great pictures that well deserve their places. It''s really difficult in my opinion to compare such different pictures and choose one or the other, every picture entered has something unique. My main reason for taking part is really mostly to get new impulses and a reason to get off the couch, if I some day can earn a ribbon that''ll just be icing on the cake. Hunting for subjects for challenges is much more fun than TV re-runs. :-)</td>', 'Thanks eveyone for voting and commenting! I''m very happy with the 10th place for my first entry, the winners are great pictures that well deserve their places. It''s really difficult in my opinion to compare such different pictures and choose one or the other, every picture entered has something unique. My main reason for taking part is really mostly to get new impulses and a reason to get off the couch, if I some day can earn a ribbon that''ll just be icing on the cake. Hunting for subjects for challenges is much more fun than TV re-runs. :-)', '2005-10-25 19:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
