(1812178, 245015, 5044, '<td valign="top">Hey awesome shot. I''m a BIG fan of the FishEye. I have two of them myself. I wanted to enter a shot using my 8mm Peleng, but just couldn''t find the time to shoot that week. I''m glad because it would have paled compared to this tremendous capture. I love NY and I love the FE. Very well done and well earned ribbon. CONGRATS!</td>', 'Hey awesome shot. I''m a BIG fan of the FishEye. I have two of them myself. I wanted to enter a shot using my 8mm Peleng, but just couldn''t find the time to shoot that week. I''m glad because it would have paled compared to this tremendous capture. I love NY and I love the FE. Very well done and well earned ribbon. CONGRATS!', '2005-10-25 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
