(1813818, 245149, 32767, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh, so it was you who was launching The Titanic Death Cruise, Through Hurricane Wilma. Scary-ass clouds and boats don''t mix, if you ask me. I started gasping for air once the thumbnail went to 640x? On the other hand, it''s a really nice image. Well done but I don''t think Carnivale or The Norwegian Line will be using it in any adds, too soon.<br/> <br/>;)</td>', 'Ahhhh, so it was you who was launching The Titanic Death Cruise, Through Hurricane Wilma. Scary-ass clouds and boats don''t mix, if you ask me. I started gasping for air once the thumbnail went to 640x? On the other hand, it''s a really nice image. Well done but I don''t think Carnivale or The Norwegian Line will be using it in any adds, too soon. ;)', '2005-10-26 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
