(1815127, 242985, 38234, '<td valign="top">I''m very new here so I apologize for the late response - I didn''t realize until after reading a couple threads in the forums that I could see these comments after voting was finished.<br/>So thank you very much for your kind words and generous votes.  Richard, this is a tough place to figure out but I''ll keep at it as oftem as I can - it''s a great way to "challenge" my thinking and creativity.  But the best part is - it''s just fun:-)</td>', 'I''m very new here so I apologize for the late response - I didn''t realize until after reading a couple threads in the forums that I could see these comments after voting was finished.So thank you very much for your kind words and generous votes.  Richard, this is a tough place to figure out but I''ll keep at it as oftem as I can - it''s a great way to "challenge" my thinking and creativity.  But the best part is - it''s just fun:-)', '2005-10-26 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
