(1988107, 243795, 4226, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nshapiro:</b></div><hr/><i> This is really great Keith!  Congratulations on 4th place here!  The motion effect here is so strong--I see you added motion blur, so I''m curious if the jet was moving at the time?  Anyway, it''s fantastic and going into my favorites. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>first look makes you think the jet is moving, but a closer look at the nose clarifies. If the jet was moving, the numbers 2,4 reflected in the jet will have motion blur which they don''t. That says motion blur was added in photoshop.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by nshapiro: This is really great Keith!  Congratulations on 4th place here!  The motion effect here is so strong--I see you added motion blur, so I''m curious if the jet was moving at the time?  Anyway, it''s fantastic and going into my favorites.  first look makes you think the jet is moving, but a closer look at the nose clarifies. If the jet was moving, the numbers 2,4 reflected in the jet will have motion blur which they don''t. That says motion blur was added in photoshop.', '2005-12-30 09:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
